Comment: 0,0:00:00.98,0:00:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,~Dialogue~
Dialogue: 9,0:01:43.04,0:01:45.54,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,小梅  你总是这么讲究啊
Dialogue: 8,0:01:43.04,0:01:45.54,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,さっちゃん　いつも丁寧だよね
Dialogue: 9,0:01:45.96,0:01:48.96,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,我的手真的容易裂啦
Dialogue: 8,0:01:45.96,0:01:48.96,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,ウチ手荒れマジヤバいからさぁ
Dialogue: 9,0:01:48.96,0:01:49.84,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,你也来点吗？
Dialogue: 8,0:01:48.96,0:01:49.84,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,ゆりちも塗る？
Dialogue: 9,0:01:49.84,0:01:52.22,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,好！我要涂得满满的！
Dialogue: 8,0:01:49.84,0:01:52.22,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,ふむ！ドンドン塗りまくるよ
Dialogue: 9,0:01:52.22,0:01:52.97,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,给我吧！
Dialogue: 8,0:01:52.22,0:01:52.97,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,ちょうだい！
Dialogue: 9,0:01:52.97,0:01:55.01,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,哇！不是吧？
Dialogue: 8,0:01:52.97,0:01:55.01,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,うわっ　マジヤバい　マジ!?
Dialogue: 9,0:01:55.01,0:01:57.47,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,你的手太漂亮了！
Dialogue: 8,0:01:55.01,0:01:57.47,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,ゆりち　手ぇきれいすぎ！
Dialogue: 9,0:01:57.97,0:02:01.89,Text - CN,Sazanka,800,0,0,,话说   你可得好好保养啊
Dialogue: 8,0:01:57.97,0:02:01.89,Text - JP,Sazanka,800,0,0,,つうかさ　マジでケアせんと
Dialogue: 9,0:01:58.18,0:02:00.22,Text - CN,Yuri,0,800,0,,诶  是吗？
Dialogue: 8,0:01:58.18,0:02:00.22,Text - JP,Yuri,0,800,0,,え　そうかな？
Dialogue: 9,0:02:02.69,0:02:04.44,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,阿雏也要擦一点吗？
Dialogue: 8,0:02:02.69,0:02:04.44,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,ひなぴもケアしとく？
Dialogue: 9,0:02:04.44,0:02:05.98,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,我不要
Dialogue: 8,0:02:04.44,0:02:05.98,Text - JP,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,ひな的にいらない
Dialogue: 9,0:02:05.98,0:02:08.48,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,真!? 皮肤皲裂了怎么办？
Dialogue: 8,0:02:05.98,0:02:08.48,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,マ!?　手荒れしたらヤバいじゃん
Comment: 9,0:02:08.48,0:02:11.82,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,擦了手上滑溜溜的  是一种 (Debuff,减益效果)
Dialogue: 9,0:02:08.48,0:02:11.82,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,擦了手上滑溜溜的  是一种 Debuff
Dialogue: 9,0:02:08.48,0:02:11.82,RUBY,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,{\fs40\pos(1283,965)}减益效果
Dialogue: 8,0:02:08.48,0:02:11.82,Text - JP,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,手が滑るから　デバフ入る
Dialogue: 9,0:02:11.82,0:02:13.11,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,Debuff 吗
Dialogue: 8,0:02:11.82,0:02:13.11,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,デバフかぁ
Dialogue: 9,0:02:13.11,0:02:15.45,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,Debuff 确实不得了啊
Dialogue: 8,0:02:13.11,0:02:15.45,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,デバフ　マジヤバいからな！
Dialogue: 9,0:02:15.45,0:02:18.45,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,有罪  你是完全没听懂吧
Dialogue: 8,0:02:15.45,0:02:18.45,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,ギルティ　全然わかってないだろ？
Dialogue: 9,0:02:17.70,0:02:19.29,Text - CN - top,Sazanka,0,0,0,,嗯？什么？
Dialogue: 8,0:02:17.70,0:02:19.29,Text - JP - top,Sazanka,0,0,0,,ん？まあね
Dialogue: 9,0:02:18.91,0:02:22.96,Text - CN,Erika,0,0,0,,但是  小雏  你的眼眼该休息了吧
Dialogue: 8,0:02:18.91,0:02:22.96,Text - JP,Erika,0,0,0,,でも　ひなちゃん　そろそろおめめ疲れてるんじゃない？
Dialogue: 9,0:02:22.96,0:02:24.08,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,楠姐…
Dialogue: 8,0:02:22.96,0:02:24.08,Text - JP,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,えりねえ…
Dialogue: 9,0:02:24.08,0:02:25.46,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,什么年代了还说「眼眼」
Dialogue: 8,0:02:24.08,0:02:25.46,Text - JP,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,きょうび　おめめて
Comment: 9,0:02:30.00,0:02:32.01,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,我上 (Buff,增益效果) 了  所以不累
Dialogue: 9,0:02:30.00,0:02:32.01,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,我上 Buff 了  所以不累
Dialogue: 9,0:02:30.00,0:02:32.01,RUBY,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,{\fs40\pos(864,965)}增益效果
Dialogue: 8,0:02:30.00,0:02:32.01,Text - JP,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,バフ入ったから大丈夫
Dialogue: 9,0:02:32.42,0:02:34.47,Text - CN,Erika,0,0,0,,大姐姐的人生智慧！
Dialogue: 8,0:02:32.42,0:02:34.47,Text - JP,Erika,0,0,0,,おねえちゃんの知恵袋！
Dialogue: 9,0:02:34.47,0:02:39.51,Text - CN,Erika,0,0,0,,眼眼累的时候  要看远处的东西来放松
Dialogue: 8,0:02:34.47,0:02:39.51,Text - JP,Erika,0,0,0,,おめめが疲れたときは　遠くを見るようにするとストレッチになるの
Dialogue: 9,0:02:39.51,0:02:42.27,Text - CN,Erika,0,0,0,,来  跟姐姐一起做
Dialogue: 8,0:02:39.51,0:02:42.27,Text - JP,Erika,0,0,0,,はい　おねえちゃんと一緒にしよ
Dialogue: 9,0:02:42.27,0:02:44.73,Text - CN,Erika,0,0,0,,要不用热毛巾敷也可以
Dialogue: 8,0:02:42.27,0:02:44.73,Text - JP,Erika,0,0,0,,蒸しタオルをのせるのもいいわよ
Dialogue: 9,0:02:44.73,0:02:46.15,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,那我不就看不见了
Dialogue: 8,0:02:44.73,0:02:46.15,Text - JP,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,前見えねえだろ？
Dialogue: 9,0:02:46.56,0:02:48.90,Text - CN,Erika,0,0,0,,那就看远处吧
Dialogue: 8,0:02:46.56,0:02:48.90,Text - JP,Erika,0,0,0,,じゃあ　遠くを見るほうで
Dialogue: 9,0:02:49.52,0:02:50.53,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,它们来了
Dialogue: 8,0:02:49.52,0:02:50.53,Text - JP,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,こっち来てる
Dialogue: 9,0:02:50.90,0:02:51.73,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,真的？
Dialogue: 8,0:02:50.90,0:02:51.73,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,マジ？
Dialogue: 9,0:02:51.73,0:02:53.74,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,「滴嘟滴嘟」的感觉
Dialogue: 8,0:02:51.73,0:02:53.74,Text - JP,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,ビコーンビコーンって感じ
Dialogue: 9,0:02:53.74,0:02:55.15,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,真是「滴咚」啊
Dialogue: 8,0:02:53.74,0:02:55.15,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,マジ　ビコーン！な
Dialogue: 9,0:02:55.57,0:02:57.82,Text - CN,Erika,0,0,0,,哎呀呀  是纸箱大叔吧？
Dialogue: 8,0:02:55.57,0:02:57.82,Text - JP,Erika,0,0,0,,あらあら　段ボールのオジサンね？
Dialogue: 9,0:02:57.82,0:02:58.53,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,大叔…
Dialogue: 8,0:02:57.82,0:02:58.53,Text - JP,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,オジ…
Dialogue: 9,0:02:58.53,0:03:00.83,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,这不是重点
Dialogue: 8,0:02:58.53,0:03:00.83,Text - JP,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,そこは重要じゃねえから
Dialogue: 9,0:03:01.74,0:03:02.91,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,行了  我们走
Dialogue: 8,0:03:01.74,0:03:02.91,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,いいから行くぞ
Dialogue: 9,0:03:04.71,0:03:06.21,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,OK 哟
Dialogue: 8,0:03:04.71,0:03:06.21,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,おけまる
Dialogue: 9,0:03:06.21,0:03:08.58,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,切  只能先中断游戏了么
Dialogue: 8,0:03:06.21,0:03:08.58,Text - JP,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,チッ　中断しとくか
Dialogue: 9,0:03:09.21,0:03:10.46,Text - CN,Erika,0,0,0,,之后再慢慢玩吧
Dialogue: 8,0:03:09.21,0:03:10.46,Text - JP,Erika,0,0,0,,あとでゆっくりね
Dialogue: 9,0:03:10.46,0:03:13.13,Text - CN,Yuri,0,800,0,,把用不到的东西先放在这里
Dialogue: 8,0:03:10.46,0:03:13.13,Text - JP,Yuri,0,800,0,,今　いらないものは　置いていって大丈夫だよ
Dialogue: 9,0:03:10.71,0:03:13.42,Text - CN - top,Ayame,0,800,0,,茶梅  把护手霜放下
Dialogue: 8,0:03:10.71,0:03:13.42,Text - JP - top,Ayame,0,800,0,,さざんか　ハンドクリームは置いていけ
Dialogue: 9,0:03:12.46,0:03:14.72,Text - CN,Hinageshi,1200,0,0,,楠姐  你忘记外套了
Dialogue: 8,0:03:12.46,0:03:14.72,Text - JP,Hinageshi,1200,0,0,,えりねえ　服忘れてる
Dialogue: 9,0:03:14.72,0:03:16.05,Text - CN,Erika,1200,0,0,,哎哎呀
Dialogue: 8,0:03:14.72,0:03:16.05,Text - JP,Erika,1200,0,0,,あら？あらあら…
Dialogue: 9,0:03:16.55,0:03:17.84,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,OK！
Dialogue: 8,0:03:16.55,0:03:17.84,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,オッケー
Dialogue: 9,0:03:17.84,0:03:20.05,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,让我们气势满满地出发吧
Dialogue: 8,0:03:17.84,0:03:20.05,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,ドンドンドーンといこっか
Dialogue: 9,0:03:20.05,0:03:21.43,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,我们出发了！
Dialogue: 8,0:03:20.05,0:03:21.43,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,いってきます！
Dialogue: 9,0:03:21.43,0:03:22.47,Text - CN,Ayame; Sazanka,0,0,0,,这又不是出门散步！
Dialogue: 8,0:03:21.43,0:03:22.47,Text - JP,Ayame; Sazanka,0,0,0,,お出かけか！
Dialogue: 9,0:03:22.47,0:03:24.56,Text - CN,Erika,0,0,0,,边走边玩游戏很危险的
Dialogue: 8,0:03:22.47,0:03:24.56,Text - JP,Erika,0,0,0,,歩きながらのゲームは危ないわ
Dialogue: 9,0:03:24.56,0:03:25.85,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,等我把这段打完
Dialogue: 8,0:03:24.56,0:03:25.85,Text - JP,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,きりのいいとこまで
Dialogue: 9,0:03:28.19,0:03:30.57,Text - CN,Erika,0,0,0,,哎呀呀  小鸢可真有干劲！
Dialogue: 8,0:03:28.19,0:03:30.57,Text - JP,Erika,0,0,0,,あらあら　あやちゃん元気！
Dialogue: 9,0:03:32.40,0:03:35.32,Text - CN,Erika,0,0,0,,没必要赶得那么急的
Dialogue: 8,0:03:32.40,0:03:35.32,Text - JP,Erika,0,0,0,,そんなに急がなくてもいいのに
Dialogue: 9,0:03:39.28,0:03:40.12,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,近了
Dialogue: 8,0:03:39.28,0:03:40.12,Text - JP,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,近い
Dialogue: 9,0:04:00.34,0:04:01.97,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,雏芥子  别玩游戏了！
Dialogue: 8,0:04:00.34,0:04:01.97,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,ひなげし　ゲーム終わり！
Dialogue: 9,0:04:01.97,0:04:03.35,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,真扫兴
Dialogue: 8,0:04:01.97,0:04:03.35,Text - JP,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,マジ　だりぃ
Dialogue: 9,0:04:03.35,0:04:05.60,Text - CN,Erika,0,0,0,,小雏  等等我！
Dialogue: 8,0:04:03.35,0:04:05.60,Text - JP,Erika,0,0,0,,ひなちゃ～ん　待って！
Dialogue: 9,0:04:05.60,0:04:06.77,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,楠姐  赶快
Dialogue: 8,0:04:05.60,0:04:06.77,Text - JP,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,えりねえ遅ぇよ
Dialogue: 9,0:04:06.77,0:04:08.06,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,你摇得太夸张了吧！
Dialogue: 8,0:04:06.77,0:04:08.06,Text - JP,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,揺れすぎ！
Comment: 9,0:04:09.06,0:04:11.56,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,真是的  都怪这臭(狂猎,Wild Hunt)
Dialogue: 9,0:04:09.06,0:04:11.56,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,真是的  都怪这臭狂猎
Dialogue: 9,0:04:09.06,0:04:11.56,RUBY,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,{\fs40\pos(1166,965)}Wild Hunt
Dialogue: 8,0:04:09.06,0:04:11.56,Text - JP,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,ったくよ… ワイルドハントのクソボケ
Dialogue: 9,0:04:11.56,0:04:12.90,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,新游戏开始！
Dialogue: 8,0:04:11.56,0:04:12.90,Text - JP,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,ニューゲームスタート！
Dialogue: 9,0:04:16.28,0:04:17.11,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,来了！
Dialogue: 8,0:04:16.28,0:04:17.11,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,来たわ！
Dialogue: 9,0:04:20.82,0:04:22.53,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,我讨厌死这声音了
Dialogue: 8,0:04:20.82,0:04:22.53,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,大嫌いな音
Comment: 9,0:04:22.53,0:04:25.08,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,这是(狂猎,Wild Hunt)消除人类时的声音
Dialogue: 9,0:04:22.53,0:04:25.08,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,这是狂猎消除人类时的声音
Dialogue: 9,0:04:22.53,0:04:25.08,RUBY,Yuri,0,0,0,,{\fs40\pos(793,965)}Wild Hunt
Dialogue: 8,0:04:22.53,0:04:25.08,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,人間を消しちゃうワイルドハントの声
Dialogue: 9,0:04:25.33,0:04:28.08,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,800,0,,这声音老远就听得到  吵死了
Dialogue: 8,0:04:25.33,0:04:28.08,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,800,0,,ってか　遠くまで届くし　マジうざいわ
Dialogue: 9,0:04:27.29,0:04:29.00,Text - CN,Hinageshi,1000,0,0,,这什么垃圾角色！
Dialogue: 8,0:04:27.29,0:04:29.00,Text - JP,Hinageshi,1000,0,0,,こんのクソキャラが！
Dialogue: 9,0:04:29.00,0:04:30.79,Text - CN,Hinageshi,1000,0,0,,必须得把这个挂逼干掉！
Dialogue: 8,0:04:29.00,0:04:30.79,Text - JP,Hinageshi,1000,0,0,,チート野郎ぶっ倒すしかねえ！
Dialogue: 9,0:04:31.17,0:04:34.38,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,看我小小 Carry 一局  把你虐到超鬼！
Dialogue: 8,0:04:31.17,0:04:34.38,Text - JP,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,軽くキャリーして　床ペロさせてやんよ！
Dialogue: 9,0:04:36.51,0:04:37.84,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,放马过来吧
Dialogue: 8,0:04:36.51,0:04:37.84,Text - JP,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,やってやんよ
Comment: 9,0:04:37.84,0:04:39.47,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,(安德瓦里,Andvari)  展开！
Dialogue: 9,0:04:37.84,0:04:39.47,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,安德瓦里  展开！
Dialogue: 9,0:04:37.84,0:04:39.47,RUBY,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,{\fs40\pos(864,965)}Andvari
Dialogue: 8,0:04:37.84,0:04:39.47,Text - JP,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,アンドヴァリ・エクステンド！
Dialogue: 9,0:04:46.31,0:04:47.14,Text - CN,Erika,0,0,0,,小雏！
Dialogue: 8,0:04:46.31,0:04:47.14,Text - JP,Erika,0,0,0,,ひなちゃん！
Dialogue: 9,0:04:47.14,0:04:48.56,Text - CN,Erika,0,0,0,,姐姐我也
Dialogue: 8,0:04:47.14,0:04:48.56,Text - JP,Erika,0,0,0,,おねえちゃんも
Comment: 9,0:04:48.56,0:04:51.02,Text - CN,Erika,0,0,0,,(安德瓦里,Andvari)  展开！
Dialogue: 9,0:04:48.56,0:04:51.02,Text - CN,Erika,0,0,0,,安德瓦里  展开！
Dialogue: 9,0:04:48.56,0:04:51.02,RUBY,Erika,0,0,0,,{\fs40\pos(864,965)}Andvari
Dialogue: 8,0:04:48.56,0:04:51.02,Text - JP,Erika,0,0,0,,アンドヴァリ・エクステンド！
Comment: 9,0:04:54.94,0:04:58.11,Text - CN,Erika,0,0,0,,昂首挺立  (米德加尔德,Miðgarðr)！
Dialogue: 9,0:04:54.94,0:04:58.11,Text - CN,Erika,0,0,0,,昂首挺立  米德加尔德！
Dialogue: 9,0:04:54.94,0:04:58.11,RUBY,Erika,0,0,0,,{\fs40\pos(1055,965)}Miðgarðr
Dialogue: 8,0:04:54.94,0:04:58.11,Text - JP,Erika,0,0,0,,そびえ立て　ミズガルズ！
Dialogue: 9,0:05:01.11,0:05:04.83,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,气·势·满·满！
Dialogue: 8,0:05:01.11,0:05:04.83,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,ドーンドーンドーンドーンドーン！
Dialogue: 9,0:05:04.83,0:05:07.66,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,各位  用团队配合打败它们！
Dialogue: 8,0:05:04.83,0:05:07.66,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,みんな　チーム戦でやっつけるよ
Dialogue: 9,0:05:07.66,0:05:08.79,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,作战计划是…
Dialogue: 8,0:05:07.66,0:05:08.79,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,作戦は…
Dialogue: 9,0:05:07.66,0:05:08.79,Text - CN - top,Sazanka,0,0,0,,OK 哟！
Dialogue: 8,0:05:07.66,0:05:08.79,Text - JP - top,Sazanka,0,0,0,,おけまる！
Dialogue: 9,0:05:09.25,0:05:11.50,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,集中火力让它无暇反击！
Dialogue: 8,0:05:09.25,0:05:11.50,Text - JP,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,反撃させずに集中攻撃！
Dialogue: 9,0:05:11.50,0:05:12.79,Text - CN,Erika,0,0,0,,对  没错！
Dialogue: 8,0:05:11.50,0:05:12.79,Text - JP,Erika,0,0,0,,そう　それ！
Dialogue: 9,0:05:12.79,0:05:14.34,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,是它就是它！
Dialogue: 8,0:05:12.79,0:05:14.34,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,それオブそれな！
Dialogue: 9,0:05:14.92,0:05:18.05,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,「打破防就跑路  让它陷入眩晕」
Dialogue: 8,0:05:14.92,0:05:18.05,Text - JP,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,「崩す～　置いてく　ピヨらせる～」
Comment: 9,0:05:18.30,0:05:20.51,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,束缚它  (格莱普尼尔,Gleipnir)！
Dialogue: 9,0:05:18.30,0:05:20.51,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,束缚它  格莱普尼尔！
Dialogue: 9,0:05:18.30,0:05:20.51,RUBY,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,{\fs40\pos(1027,965)}Gleipnir
Dialogue: 8,0:05:18.30,0:05:20.51,Text - JP,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,絡め取れ　グレイプニル！
Dialogue: 9,0:05:24.64,0:05:26.43,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,我的入侵起效了
Dialogue: 8,0:05:24.64,0:05:26.43,Text - JP,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,ひな的なハッキングが効いた
Dialogue: 9,0:05:26.43,0:05:27.22,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,茶梅！
Dialogue: 8,0:05:26.43,0:05:27.22,Text - JP,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,さざんかくん！
Dialogue: 9,0:05:26.76,0:05:27.64,Text - CN,Sazanka,800,0,0,,OK 哟！
Dialogue: 8,0:05:26.76,0:05:27.64,Text - JP,Sazanka,800,0,0,,おけまる！
Dialogue: 9,0:05:27.64,0:05:29.18,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,机会来了！
Dialogue: 8,0:05:27.64,0:05:29.18,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,好機到来じゃん！
Dialogue: 9,0:05:30.31,0:05:30.94,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,糟糕！
Dialogue: 8,0:05:30.31,0:05:30.94,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,ヤバッ！
Dialogue: 9,0:05:33.94,0:05:35.40,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,骗你的！
Dialogue: 8,0:05:33.94,0:05:35.40,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,な～んつて！
Dialogue: 9,0:05:35.40,0:05:39.19,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,神闪避接大招
Dialogue: 8,0:05:35.40,0:05:39.19,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,避けぽよからの～　神ムーブみたいな
Comment: 9,0:05:39.19,0:05:41.95,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,别打偏了  我的(阿冈,Gungnir)
Dialogue: 9,0:05:39.19,0:05:41.95,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,别打偏了  我的阿冈
Dialogue: 9,0:05:39.19,0:05:41.95,RUBY,Sazanka,0,0,0,,{\fs40\pos(1138,965)}Gungnir
Dialogue: 8,0:05:39.19,0:05:41.95,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,マジ当たってよ　ウチのグングン！
Dialogue: 9,0:05:48.16,0:05:49.37,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,班长！
Dialogue: 8,0:05:48.16,0:05:49.37,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,{にやり}委員長！
Dialogue: 9,0:05:49.37,0:05:51.54,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,别叫我班长！我叫鸢尾
Dialogue: 8,0:05:49.37,0:05:51.54,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,委員長言うな！あやめだ
Dialogue: 9,0:05:51.54,0:05:53.46,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,「一个不留消灭所有人类」
Dialogue: 8,0:05:51.54,0:05:53.46,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,「人々を根絶やしに駆逐」
Dialogue: 9,0:05:53.46,0:05:56.88,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,我能理解这是你们为了生存而采取的行动
Dialogue: 8,0:05:53.46,0:05:56.88,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,それが貴殿たちの　生きるための行動だとは認識している
Dialogue: 9,0:05:56.88,0:06:00.21,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,但是！这在我们人类看来是大逆不道！
Dialogue: 8,0:05:56.88,0:06:00.21,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,しかし！我々人類から見ればそれは外道！
Dialogue: 9,0:06:00.55,0:06:01.88,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,令人作呕！
Dialogue: 8,0:06:00.55,0:06:01.88,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,嫌悪！
Dialogue: 9,0:06:01.88,0:06:03.80,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,强者  陨落吧
Dialogue: 8,0:06:01.88,0:06:03.80,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,強き者よ　朽ちろ
Dialogue: 9,0:06:03.80,0:06:05.26,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,降下火焰的制裁
Dialogue: 8,0:06:03.80,0:06:05.26,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,裁くは炎
Comment: 9,0:06:05.26,0:06:07.39,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,低吟吧  我的爱剑  (苏尔特,Surtr)！
Dialogue: 9,0:06:05.26,0:06:07.39,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,低吟吧  我的爱剑  苏尔特！
Dialogue: 9,0:06:05.26,0:06:07.39,RUBY,Ayame,0,0,0,,{\fs40\pos(1151,965)}Surtr
Dialogue: 8,0:06:05.26,0:06:07.39,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,唸れ　我が愛剣スルトよ！
Dialogue: 9,0:06:08.35,0:06:10.22,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,这是对你的审判！
Dialogue: 8,0:06:08.35,0:06:10.22,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,これが断罪だ！
Dialogue: 9,0:06:10.22,0:06:11.64,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,百合  快补刀！
Dialogue: 8,0:06:10.22,0:06:11.64,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,ゆり　トドメを！
Dialogue: 9,0:06:14.02,0:06:15.31,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,OK
Dialogue: 8,0:06:14.02,0:06:15.31,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,オーケー
Comment: 9,0:06:15.31,0:06:16.86,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,(狂猎,Wild Hunt)很强
Dialogue: 9,0:06:15.31,0:06:16.86,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,狂猎很强
Dialogue: 9,0:06:15.31,0:06:16.86,RUBY,Yuri,0,0,0,,{\fs40\pos(904,965)}Wild Hunt
Dialogue: 8,0:06:15.31,0:06:16.86,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,ワイルドハントは強い
Dialogue: 9,0:06:16.86,0:06:19.61,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,但有大家在就一点都不可怕！
Dialogue: 8,0:06:16.86,0:06:19.61,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,みんなといると全然怖くない！
Dialogue: 9,0:06:19.61,0:06:21.28,Text - CN,Yuri,800,0,0,,你们太棒了！
Dialogue: 8,0:06:19.61,0:06:21.28,Text - JP,Yuri,800,0,0,,みんな　最高！
Dialogue: 9,0:06:21.28,0:06:22.95,Text - CN,Yuri,800,0,0,,看我必杀技！
Dialogue: 8,0:06:21.28,0:06:22.95,Text - JP,Yuri,800,0,0,,ここで必殺！
Dialogue: 9,0:06:22.95,0:06:24.78,Text - CN,Yuri,800,0,0,,那个… 「超强的绝招」！
Dialogue: 8,0:06:22.95,0:06:24.78,Text - JP,Yuri,800,0,0,,えっと　すごく強いなにか
Dialogue: 9,0:06:24.49,0:06:25.95,Text - CN,Ayame,0,1200,0,,有罪！你这太敷衍了！
Dialogue: 8,0:06:24.49,0:06:25.95,Text - JP,Ayame,0,1200,0,,ギルティ　雑だ！
Dialogue: 9,0:06:24.78,0:06:26.99,Text - CN,Yuri,800,0,0,,我开动了！
Dialogue: 8,0:06:24.78,0:06:26.99,Text - JP,Yuri,800,0,0,,いただきま～す！
Comment: 9,0:06:26.99,0:06:29.20,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,(提尔锋, Tyrfingr)！上吧！
Dialogue: 9,0:06:26.99,0:06:29.20,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,提尔锋！上吧！
Dialogue: 9,0:06:26.99,0:06:29.20,RUBY,Yuri,0,0,0,,{\fs40\pos(849,965)} Tyrfingr
Dialogue: 8,0:06:26.99,0:06:29.20,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,ティルフィング　ドーン！
Dialogue: 9,0:06:33.50,0:06:35.29,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,今天也是战果满满啊！
Dialogue: 8,0:06:33.50,0:06:35.29,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,今日もドンドン決まったね！
Dialogue: 9,0:06:37.04,0:06:39.88,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,赢了  大获全胜！
Dialogue: 8,0:06:37.04,0:06:39.88,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,勝った　勝利だよ！
Dialogue: 9,0:06:39.88,0:06:41.26,Text - CN - top,Yuri,0,0,0,,团队配合默契无间！
Dialogue: 8,0:06:39.88,0:06:41.26,Text - JP - top,Yuri,0,0,0,,チームワーク　バッチリ！
Dialogue: 9,0:06:40.25,0:06:42.13,Text - CN,Hinageshi,800,0,0,,哇  有点头晕
Dialogue: 8,0:06:40.25,0:06:42.13,Text - JP,Hinageshi,800,0,0,,うわ　立ち眩み
Dialogue: 9,0:06:41.01,0:06:42.72,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,800,0,,我好像真把护手霜搞丢了？
Dialogue: 8,0:06:41.01,0:06:42.72,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,800,0,,ハンドクリーム　マジ落とした？
Dialogue: 9,0:06:41.55,0:06:43.80,Text - CN - top,Erika,0,1100,0,,哇  看起来真爽
Dialogue: 8,0:06:41.55,0:06:43.80,Text - JP - top,Erika,0,1100,0,,うわ　快楽そう
Dialogue: 9,0:06:42.59,0:06:44.18,Text - CN,Ayame,800,0,0,,有罪  在你口袋里
Dialogue: 8,0:06:42.59,0:06:44.18,Text - JP,Ayame,800,0,0,,ギルティ　ポケット
Dialogue: 9,0:06:43.05,0:06:44.51,Text - CN - top,Yuri,0,0,0,,以后也要保持下去
Dialogue: 8,0:06:43.05,0:06:44.51,Text - JP - top,Yuri,0,0,0,,ドンドン先に
Dialogue: 9,0:06:43.92,0:06:45.84,Text - CN - top,Sazanka,1000,0,0,,这配合真的绝了！
Dialogue: 8,0:06:43.92,0:06:45.84,Text - JP - top,Sazanka,1000,0,0,,チームワーク　マジ卍おつ！
Dialogue: 9,0:06:46.22,0:06:48.14,Text - CN,All,0,0,0,,辛苦了！
Dialogue: 8,0:06:46.22,0:06:48.14,Text - JP,All,0,0,0,,おつかれ！
Dialogue: 9,0:06:48.43,0:06:49.89,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,之后要做什么？
Dialogue: 8,0:06:48.43,0:06:49.89,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,このあと　どうする？
Dialogue: 9,0:06:50.22,0:06:52.73,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,说来  我刚才发现家好店
Dialogue: 8,0:06:50.22,0:06:52.73,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,そういえば　さっきいいお店見つけたんだ
Dialogue: 9,0:06:53.02,0:06:54.56,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,当真？不得了！
Dialogue: 8,0:06:53.02,0:06:54.56,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,マジマジ　ヤバい！
Dialogue: 9,0:06:54.56,0:06:57.10,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,什么店？我们去吧  马上走！
Dialogue: 8,0:06:54.56,0:06:57.10,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,何の店？　すぐ行こう　今行こう！
Dialogue: 9,0:06:57.10,0:06:59.07,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,我的 HP 耗尽了
Dialogue: 8,0:06:57.10,0:06:59.07,Text - JP,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,HP　もうない
Dialogue: 9,0:06:59.07,0:07:01.28,Text - CN,Erika,0,0,0,,还是得让眼眼休息会儿啊
Dialogue: 8,0:06:59.07,0:07:01.28,Text - JP,Erika,0,0,0,,やっぱり　おめめ休めないと
Dialogue: 9,0:07:01.28,0:07:03.24,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,那大家一起来睡午觉？
Dialogue: 8,0:07:01.28,0:07:03.24,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,じゃあ　みんなでお昼寝する？
Dialogue: 9,0:07:03.24,0:07:05.28,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,要先处理善后
Dialogue: 8,0:07:03.24,0:07:05.28,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,ワイルドハントの片づけが先だ
Dialogue: 9,0:07:05.28,0:07:06.91,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,不能就这样置之不理
Dialogue: 8,0:07:05.28,0:07:06.91,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,散らかしっぱなしにしない
Dialogue: 9,0:07:06.91,0:07:09.66,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,班长！你当真是班长啊
Dialogue: 8,0:07:06.91,0:07:09.66,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,委員長！マジ委員長じゃん
Dialogue: 9,0:07:10.79,0:07:12.24,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,好孤单…
Dialogue: 8,0:07:10.79,0:07:12.24,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,寂しい…
Dialogue: 9,0:07:12.83,0:07:14.50,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,好孤单啊…
Dialogue: 8,0:07:12.83,0:07:14.50,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,寂しいよ…
Dialogue: 9,0:07:15.62,0:07:16.54,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,一开始…
Dialogue: 8,0:07:15.62,0:07:16.54,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,はじめは…
Dialogue: 9,0:07:17.54,0:07:18.54,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,一开始…
Dialogue: 8,0:07:17.54,0:07:18.54,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,はじめは…
Dialogue: 9,0:07:20.42,0:07:21.59,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,一开始…
Dialogue: 8,0:07:20.42,0:07:21.59,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,はじめは…
Dialogue: 9,0:07:22.17,0:07:24.17,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,天空样子变得奇怪
Dialogue: 8,0:07:22.17,0:07:24.17,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,空がおかしくなって
Dialogue: 9,0:07:25.05,0:07:26.47,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,好孤单…
Dialogue: 8,0:07:25.05,0:07:26.47,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,寂しい…
Dialogue: 9,0:07:29.97,0:07:37.60,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,然后  出现了很多  很多消灭人类的机器
Dialogue: 8,0:07:29.97,0:07:37.60,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,それから　人を消してしまう機械がたくさんたくさんやってきた
Dialogue: 9,0:07:41.44,0:07:45.82,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,之后  这个星球上的人类几乎都被消灭了
Dialogue: 8,0:07:41.44,0:07:45.82,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,そうして　この世界から　ほとんどの人がいなくなって
Dialogue: 9,0:07:47.32,0:07:48.70,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,好孤单…
Dialogue: 8,0:07:47.32,0:07:48.70,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,寂しい…
Dialogue: 9,0:07:49.45,0:07:51.37,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,我一直都是一个人…
Dialogue: 8,0:07:49.45,0:07:51.37,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,私はずっと一人で…
Dialogue: 9,0:07:52.24,0:07:56.29,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,我一直都是一个人  在城市中徘徊
Dialogue: 8,0:07:52.24,0:07:56.29,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,私はずっと一人で　街をさまよっている
Dialogue: 9,0:07:57.75,0:08:00.92,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,一个人好孤单
Dialogue: 8,0:07:57.75,0:08:00.92,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,ひとりぼっちは寂しい
Dialogue: 9,0:08:01.75,0:08:03.42,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,太孤单了
Dialogue: 8,0:08:01.75,0:08:03.42,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,寂しいよ
Dialogue: 9,0:08:06.92,0:08:08.18,Text - CN,Rat,0,0,0,,啾啾
Dialogue: 8,0:08:06.92,0:08:08.18,Text - JP,Rat,0,0,0,,チューチュー
Dialogue: 9,0:08:08.18,0:08:11.22,Text - CN,Rat,0,0,0,,清扫中啾！
Dialogue: 8,0:08:08.18,0:08:11.22,Text - JP,Rat,0,0,0,,掃除チュー！
Dialogue: 9,0:08:11.22,0:08:13.51,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,不要啊！
Dialogue: 8,0:08:11.22,0:08:13.51,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,いや～！
Dialogue: 9,0:08:16.14,0:08:17.81,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,吓死我了
Dialogue: 8,0:08:16.14,0:08:17.81,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,ビックリした
Dialogue: 9,0:08:17.81,0:08:19.69,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,我还以为是那种机器
Dialogue: 8,0:08:17.81,0:08:19.69,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,あの機械かと思った
Dialogue: 9,0:08:20.10,0:08:22.06,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,它们的话不用担心
Dialogue: 8,0:08:20.10,0:08:22.06,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,この子たちなら大丈夫
Dialogue: 9,0:08:22.73,0:08:25.94,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,那些机器消除人类
Dialogue: 8,0:08:22.73,0:08:25.94,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,あの機械たちは人間を消してしまう
Dialogue: 9,0:08:25.94,0:08:27.95,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,它们拥有这种力量
Dialogue: 8,0:08:25.94,0:08:27.95,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,そんな力があった
Dialogue: 9,0:08:27.95,0:08:30.91,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,自卫队本该保护我们
Dialogue: 8,0:08:27.95,0:08:30.91,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,自衛隊がなんとかしてくれるはずだった
Dialogue: 9,0:08:30.91,0:08:37.41,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,但是  自卫队的武器却被敌人夺走  反过来对付自己
Dialogue: 8,0:08:30.91,0:08:37.41,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,でも　自衛隊が使うはずの兵器自体が敵になってしまったり　取り込まれてしまった
Dialogue: 9,0:08:37.41,0:08:39.62,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,所以他们也无能为力
Dialogue: 8,0:08:37.41,0:08:39.62,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,だから　どうしようもなかった
Dialogue: 9,0:08:40.17,0:08:42.29,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,水和电倒是都还通着
Dialogue: 8,0:08:40.17,0:08:42.29,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,電気も水道も通ってる
Dialogue: 9,0:08:42.29,0:08:45.00,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,貌似是这些小家伙们在维护
Dialogue: 8,0:08:42.29,0:08:45.00,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,この子たちがお手入れをしてくれてるみたい
Dialogue: 9,0:08:45.50,0:08:48.22,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,这些小家伙们到底是什么呢？
Dialogue: 8,0:08:45.50,0:08:48.22,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,この子たちはホントに何なんだろう？
Dialogue: 9,0:08:48.22,0:08:50.59,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,我觉得它们和那些机器是相同的东西
Dialogue: 8,0:08:48.22,0:08:50.59,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,あの機械と同じだと思うけど
Dialogue: 9,0:08:50.59,0:08:51.97,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,但是它们不发起攻击
Dialogue: 8,0:08:50.59,0:08:51.97,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,攻撃してこないし
Dialogue: 9,0:08:51.97,0:08:54.05,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,也不会叫那些机器过来
Dialogue: 8,0:08:51.97,0:08:54.05,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,機械を呼び寄せたりもしない
Dialogue: 9,0:08:53.43,0:08:56.02,Text - CN - top,Rat,0,0,0,,啾啾！你好啾！
Dialogue: 8,0:08:53.43,0:08:56.02,Text - JP - top,Rat,0,0,0,,チューチュー！挨拶チュー！
Dialogue: 9,0:08:54.81,0:08:56.81,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,一直以来承蒙你们的照顾！
Dialogue: 8,0:08:54.81,0:08:56.81,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,お世話になってます！
Dialogue: 9,0:08:57.60,0:08:58.43,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,真可爱
Dialogue: 8,0:08:57.60,0:08:58.43,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,かわいい
Dialogue: 9,0:09:03.44,0:09:05.52,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,还是没有人
Dialogue: 8,0:09:03.44,0:09:05.52,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,やっぱり誰もいない
Dialogue: 9,0:09:08.86,0:09:13.03,Text - CN - top,Yuri,0,0,0,,善后处理累死我了  满满休息一下
Dialogue: 8,0:09:08.86,0:09:13.03,Text - JP - top,Yuri,0,0,0,,片付け疲れった　ドンドン休憩
Dialogue: 9,0:09:13.03,0:09:14.70,Text - CN - top,Ayame,0,0,0,,你有罪
Dialogue: 8,0:09:13.03,0:09:14.70,Text - JP - top,Ayame,0,0,0,,…ギルティだ
Dialogue: 9,0:09:14.70,0:09:15.70,Text - CN - top,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,Buff…
Dialogue: 8,0:09:14.70,0:09:15.70,Text - JP - top,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,ブフ…
Dialogue: 9,0:09:15.70,0:09:17.20,Text - CN - top,Erika,0,0,0,,不可以吃第三个哦
Dialogue: 8,0:09:15.70,0:09:17.20,Text - JP - top,Erika,0,0,0,,3 本目はダメよ
Dialogue: 9,0:09:17.20,0:09:18.62,Text - CN - top,Sazanka,0,0,0,,这下真会胖
Dialogue: 8,0:09:17.20,0:09:18.62,Text - JP - top,Sazanka,0,0,0,,これ　マジ太りそう
Dialogue: 9,0:09:18.62,0:09:20.08,Text - CN - top,Erika,0,0,0,,偷吃有罪
Dialogue: 8,0:09:18.62,0:09:20.08,Text - JP - top,Erika,0,0,0,,つまみ食いギルティ
Dialogue: 9,0:09:20.08,0:09:21.79,Text - CN - top,Yuri,0,0,0,,就五分钟啦
Dialogue: 8,0:09:20.08,0:09:21.79,Text - JP - top,Yuri,0,0,0,,5 分だけだから
Dialogue: 9,0:09:21.79,0:09:23.88,Text - CN - top,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,然后睡两个小时
Dialogue: 8,0:09:21.79,0:09:23.88,Text - JP - top,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,からの～　2 時間寝る
Dialogue: 9,0:09:23.88,0:09:25.80,Text - CN - top,Erika,0,0,0,,哎呀  要不先泡茶？
Dialogue: 8,0:09:23.88,0:09:25.80,Text - JP - top,Erika,0,0,0,,あら　もうお茶にしちゃう？
Dialogue: 9,0:09:25.80,0:09:27.96,Text - CN - top,Yuri,0,0,0,,我们满满地全都做吧！
Dialogue: 8,0:09:25.80,0:09:27.96,Text - JP - top,Yuri,0,0,0,,ドンドン全部やっちゃおう！
Dialogue: 9,0:09:27.96,0:09:29.76,Text - CN - top,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,我要上 Buff 玩游戏
Dialogue: 8,0:09:27.96,0:09:29.76,Text - JP - top,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,バフ入れてゲーム
Dialogue: 9,0:09:29.76,0:09:31.72,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,是  是人的声音！
Dialogue: 9,0:09:29.76,0:09:31.76,Text - CN - top,Sazanka,0,800,0,,来吃点罐头吧
Dialogue: 8,0:09:29.76,0:09:31.76,Text - JP - top,Sazanka,0,800,0,,マジ　缶詰食べて
Dialogue: 8,0:09:29.76,0:09:31.72,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,ひ　人の声!?
Dialogue: 9,0:09:31.22,0:09:33.47,Text - CN - top,Erika,800,0,0,,我们泡个茶  然后午睡吧
Dialogue: 8,0:09:31.22,0:09:33.47,Text - JP - top,Erika,800,0,0,,お茶淹れて　お昼寝しよう
Dialogue: 9,0:09:36.93,0:09:38.60,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,真的是人！
Dialogue: 8,0:09:36.93,0:09:38.60,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,ホントに人がいた
Dialogue: 9,0:09:39.06,0:09:42.23,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,而且  不是幻觉！
Dialogue: 8,0:09:39.06,0:09:42.23,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,なんと　幻覚じゃない！
Comment: 9,0:09:42.98,0:09:45.48,Text - CN - top,Erika,0,0,0,,
Comment: 8,0:09:42.98,0:09:45.48,Text - JP - top,Erika,0,0,0,,でもそろそろ…　
Dialogue: 9,0:09:42.98,0:09:45.27,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,完全没做好心理准备
Dialogue: 8,0:09:42.98,0:09:45.27,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,心の準備が全然ダメ
Dialogue: 9,0:09:45.48,0:09:47.73,Text - CN - top,Sazanka,0,0,0,,就是说嘛
Dialogue: 8,0:09:45.48,0:09:47.73,Text - JP - top,Sazanka,0,0,0,,マジそれな
Dialogue: 9,0:09:46.61,0:09:49.19,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,和人交谈  是要怎么做来着？
Dialogue: 8,0:09:46.61,0:09:49.19,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,人とお話しって　どうするんだっけ？
Dialogue: 9,0:09:47.73,0:09:48.57,Text - CN - top,Erika,0,0,0,,好主意
Dialogue: 8,0:09:47.73,0:09:48.57,Text - JP - top,Erika,0,0,0,,いいよね～
Dialogue: 9,0:09:48.57,0:09:50.11,Text - CN - top,Yuri,0,0,0,,满满赞成
Dialogue: 8,0:09:48.57,0:09:50.11,Text - JP - top,Yuri,0,0,0,,ドンドン賛成
Dialogue: 9,0:09:50.11,0:09:52.49,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,打  打招呼是要分季节来着？
Dialogue: 8,0:09:50.11,0:09:52.49,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,あ　挨拶って季語がいる？
Dialogue: 9,0:09:53.70,0:09:55.32,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,冷静…
Dialogue: 8,0:09:53.70,0:09:55.32,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,落ち着いて…
Dialogue: 9,0:09:55.32,0:09:57.12,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,冷静…
Dialogue: 8,0:09:55.32,0:09:57.12,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,落ち着いて…
Dialogue: 9,0:09:57.12,0:09:59.83,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,莲华  不要表现得很可疑
Dialogue: 8,0:09:57.12,0:09:59.83,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,れんげ　怪しくないように
Dialogue: 9,0:10:01.08,0:10:04.79,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,你好  我是不可疑的莲华
Dialogue: 8,0:10:01.08,0:10:04.79,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,こんにちは　怪しくないれんげです
Dialogue: 9,0:10:05.96,0:10:07.63,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,好  就这个了
Dialogue: 8,0:10:05.96,0:10:07.63,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,よ～し　これです
Dialogue: 9,0:10:07.63,0:10:08.59,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 8,0:10:07.63,0:10:08.59,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,こんにちは
Dialogue: 9,0:10:10.59,0:10:12.42,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 8,0:10:10.59,0:10:12.42,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,こんにちは～
Dialogue: 9,0:10:14.30,0:10:16.51,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,是我们之外的人类
Dialogue: 8,0:10:14.30,0:10:16.51,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,私たち以外の人だ
Dialogue: 9,0:10:16.51,0:10:17.64,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,太好了！
Dialogue: 8,0:10:16.51,0:10:17.64,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,やった！
Dialogue: 9,0:10:17.64,0:10:18.72,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,初次见面
Dialogue: 8,0:10:17.64,0:10:18.72,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,はじめまして
Dialogue: 9,0:10:18.72,0:10:20.22,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,我叫河津百合
Dialogue: 8,0:10:18.72,0:10:20.22,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,私は河津ゆり
Dialogue: 9,0:10:20.22,0:10:21.35,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,你呢？
Dialogue: 8,0:10:20.22,0:10:21.35,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,あなたは？
Dialogue: 9,0:10:21.35,0:10:22.94,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,你是从哪里来的？
Dialogue: 8,0:10:21.35,0:10:22.94,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,どこから来たの？
Dialogue: 9,0:10:22.94,0:10:24.10,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,啊  对了！
Dialogue: 8,0:10:22.94,0:10:24.10,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,そうだ
Dialogue: 9,0:10:24.10,0:10:25.77,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,我把其他人也介绍给你认识
Dialogue: 8,0:10:24.10,0:10:25.77,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,みんなも紹介するね
Dialogue: 9,0:10:26.69,0:10:28.19,Text - CN,Yuri,0,800,0,,她叫小鸢
Dialogue: 8,0:10:26.69,0:10:28.19,Text - JP,Yuri,0,800,0,,この子があっちゃん
Dialogue: 9,0:10:28.19,0:10:31.32,Text - CN,Yuri,0,800,0,,是我们的队长  非常可靠…
Dialogue: 8,0:10:28.19,0:10:31.32,Text - JP,Yuri,0,800,0,,とっても頼りになる　私たちのリーダーで…
Dialogue: 9,0:10:29.94,0:10:32.57,Text - CN,Ayame,800,0,0,,喂  百合  有罪
Dialogue: 8,0:10:29.94,0:10:32.57,Text - JP,Ayame,800,0,0,,コラ　ゆり　ギルティだ
Dialogue: 9,0:10:32.57,0:10:33.90,Text - CN,Ayame,800,0,0,,你才是队长
Dialogue: 8,0:10:32.57,0:10:33.90,Text - JP,Ayame,800,0,0,,リーダーはゆりだ
Dialogue: 9,0:10:34.45,0:10:36.78,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,这个女孩子有点糟糕
Dialogue: 8,0:10:34.45,0:10:36.78,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,この女子マジヤバいっていうか
Dialogue: 9,0:10:42.58,0:10:47.21,Sign 75S757,Renge,0,0,0,,有人有人有人…
Dialogue: 9,0:10:42.79,0:10:44.46,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,我就说吧
Dialogue: 8,0:10:42.79,0:10:44.46,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,マジそれな
Dialogue: 9,0:10:45.25,0:10:47.21,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,怎  怎  怎  怎么办？
Dialogue: 8,0:10:45.25,0:10:47.21,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,どどどど　どうしよう？
Dialogue: 9,0:10:46.17,0:10:47.21,Text - CN - top,Hinageshi,600,0,0,,卡死了
Dialogue: 8,0:10:46.17,0:10:47.21,Text - JP - top,Hinageshi,600,0,0,,フリーズした
Dialogue: 9,0:10:47.25,0:10:50.21,Sign 75S757,Renge,0,0,0,,有人有人有人…
Dialogue: 9,0:10:47.59,0:10:50.21,Text - CN,Erika,0,0,0,,真害羞呢
Dialogue: 8,0:10:47.59,0:10:50.21,Text - JP,Erika,0,0,0,,恥ずかしがり屋さんだったのね
Dialogue: 9,0:10:57.51,0:10:59.05,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 8,0:10:57.51,0:10:59.05,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,よかった
Dialogue: 9,0:10:59.39,0:11:01.22,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,不好意思吓到你了
Dialogue: 8,0:10:59.39,0:11:01.22,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,驚かせちゃってごめんね
Dialogue: 9,0:11:01.22,0:11:03.56,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,那  那个…
Dialogue: 8,0:11:01.22,0:11:03.56,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,えっ　えっと…
Dialogue: 9,0:11:03.56,0:11:05.73,Text - CN,Yuri,0,800,0,,我重新介绍一下吧
Dialogue: 8,0:11:03.56,0:11:05.73,Text - JP,Yuri,0,800,0,,今度こそ自己紹介するね
Dialogue: 9,0:11:05.73,0:11:08.23,Text - CN,Yuri,0,800,0,,好  气势满满地来吧
Dialogue: 8,0:11:05.73,0:11:08.23,Text - JP,Yuri,0,800,0,,よ～し　ドンドンドーンといくよ
Dialogue: 9,0:11:08.23,0:11:09.61,Text - CN,Yuri,0,800,0,,我叫…
Dialogue: 8,0:11:08.23,0:11:09.61,Text - JP,Yuri,0,800,0,,私が河津…
Dialogue: 9,0:11:08.52,0:11:09.61,Text - CN,Ayame,600,0,0,,百合  等等！
Dialogue: 8,0:11:08.52,0:11:09.61,Text - JP,Ayame,600,0,0,,ゆり待て！
Dialogue: 9,0:11:10.77,0:11:13.28,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,气势满满有罪
Dialogue: 8,0:11:10.77,0:11:13.28,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,ドンドンドーンとギルティだ
Dialogue: 9,0:11:13.28,0:11:15.36,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,又吓到她怎么办
Dialogue: 8,0:11:13.28,0:11:15.36,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,また怖がらせてしまうぞ
Dialogue: 9,0:11:15.36,0:11:17.36,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,先冷静下来  好吗？
Dialogue: 8,0:11:15.36,0:11:17.36,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,ドンドン落ち着く　いいな？
Dialogue: 9,0:11:18.41,0:11:20.62,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,抱歉  我们这么吵闹
Dialogue: 8,0:11:18.41,0:11:20.62,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,騒がしくてすまなかった
Dialogue: 9,0:11:20.62,0:11:22.12,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,你也不需要紧张
Dialogue: 8,0:11:20.62,0:11:22.12,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,君も緊張しないで
Dialogue: 9,0:11:22.12,0:11:24.12,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,好… 好！
Dialogue: 8,0:11:22.12,0:11:24.12,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,は　はい～
Dialogue: 9,0:11:24.96,0:11:27.25,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,不  都说了你不需要紧张
Dialogue: 8,0:11:24.96,0:11:27.25,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,いや　緊張しなくていいので
Dialogue: 9,0:11:27.25,0:11:29.29,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,班长  你这太糟糕了啊
Dialogue: 8,0:11:27.25,0:11:29.29,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,委員長ってか　マジヤバい
Dialogue: 9,0:11:29.29,0:11:31.17,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,你叫谁班长呢
Dialogue: 8,0:11:29.29,0:11:31.17,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,誰が委員長だ？
Dialogue: 9,0:11:31.17,0:11:32.92,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,我哪里糟糕了？
Dialogue: 8,0:11:31.17,0:11:32.92,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,自分のどこがヤバい？
Dialogue: 9,0:11:32.92,0:11:34.01,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,该不会是我的表情？
Dialogue: 8,0:11:32.92,0:11:34.01,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,まさか顔!?
Dialogue: 9,0:11:34.01,0:11:36.22,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,我是说你说话太严肃了
Dialogue: 8,0:11:34.01,0:11:36.22,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,普通に話し方硬いってこと
Dialogue: 9,0:11:36.22,0:11:38.30,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,那你能不能直说啊
Dialogue: 8,0:11:36.22,0:11:38.30,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,なら　普通にそう言え
Dialogue: 9,0:11:40.05,0:11:42.14,Text - CN,Erika,0,0,0,,来  喝口茶吧
Dialogue: 8,0:11:40.05,0:11:42.14,Text - JP,Erika,0,0,0,,はい　お茶どうぞ
Dialogue: 9,0:11:42.14,0:11:43.85,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 8,0:11:42.14,0:11:43.85,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,あ　ありがとうございます
Dialogue: 9,0:11:43.85,0:11:45.39,Text - CN,Erika,0,0,0,,大姐姐的人生智慧
Dialogue: 8,0:11:43.85,0:11:45.39,Text - JP,Erika,0,0,0,,おねえちゃんの知恵袋
Dialogue: 9,0:11:45.68,0:11:49.81,Text - CN,Erika,0,0,0,,紧张时喝口茶  就能放松了
Dialogue: 8,0:11:45.68,0:11:49.81,Text - JP,Erika,0,0,0,,緊張したときは　お茶を飲むとリラックスできるわ
Dialogue: 9,0:11:51.82,0:11:53.44,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,要上点 Buff 吗？
Dialogue: 8,0:11:51.82,0:11:53.44,Text - JP,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,バフ入れとく？
Dialogue: 9,0:11:54.28,0:11:55.53,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,Buff？
Dialogue: 8,0:11:54.28,0:11:55.53,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,バフ？
Dialogue: 9,0:11:55.53,0:11:57.40,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,就是类似强化道具的
Dialogue: 8,0:11:55.53,0:11:57.40,Text - JP,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,強化とかそんなの
Dialogue: 9,0:11:57.40,0:11:58.53,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 8,0:11:57.40,0:11:58.53,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,どうも
Dialogue: 9,0:12:00.91,0:12:03.66,Text - CN,Ayame,800,0,0,,看来你冷静下来了
Dialogue: 9,0:12:00.91,0:12:03.66,Text - CN,Renge,0,800,0,,Bu… Buff？
Dialogue: 8,0:12:00.91,0:12:03.66,Text - JP,Ayame,800,0,0,,少しは落ち着いたようだな
Dialogue: 8,0:12:00.91,0:12:03.66,Text - JP,Renge,0,800,0,,バ　バフ？
Dialogue: 9,0:12:03.66,0:12:04.58,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: 8,0:12:03.66,0:12:04.58,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,自分は…
Dialogue: 9,0:12:05.12,0:12:07.62,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,我不糟糕  所以不要担心
Dialogue: 8,0:12:05.12,0:12:07.62,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,自分はヤバくないので　安心してくれ
Dialogue: 9,0:12:08.08,0:12:11.04,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,话说自己说自己不糟糕的才很糟糕吧？
Dialogue: 8,0:12:08.08,0:12:11.04,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,ってか　自分でヤバくないって言うのマジヤバくねえ？
Dialogue: 9,0:12:12.13,0:12:14.63,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,那现在是自我介绍时间！
Dialogue: 8,0:12:12.13,0:12:14.63,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,じゃあ　自己紹介タイムだね！
Dialogue: 9,0:12:14.63,0:12:18.76,Sign 75S757,Renge,0,0,0,,慌慌！张张！
Dialogue: 9,0:12:15.21,0:12:16.76,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,已经没事了吧
Dialogue: 8,0:12:15.21,0:12:16.76,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,もう大丈夫？
Dialogue: 9,0:12:16.76,0:12:18.38,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,我们气势满满地上吧
Dialogue: 8,0:12:16.76,0:12:18.38,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,ドンドンいくね！
Dialogue: 9,0:12:19.51,0:12:20.84,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,我叫百合
Dialogue: 8,0:12:19.51,0:12:20.84,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,私はゆり
Dialogue: 9,0:12:20.84,0:12:22.26,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,然后下一个！
Dialogue: 8,0:12:20.84,0:12:22.26,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,ドンドン次！
Dialogue: 9,0:12:23.97,0:12:25.85,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,我叫鸢尾
Dialogue: 8,0:12:23.97,0:12:25.85,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,自分はあやめという
Dialogue: 9,0:12:25.85,0:12:26.64,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,不糟糕
Dialogue: 8,0:12:25.85,0:12:26.64,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,ヤバくない
Dialogue: 9,0:12:26.64,0:12:28.48,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,我叫茶梅！
Dialogue: 8,0:12:26.64,0:12:28.48,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,ウチがさざんか！
Dialogue: 9,0:12:28.48,0:12:29.73,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,叫我小梅吧！
Dialogue: 8,0:12:28.48,0:12:29.73,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,サンちゃんって呼んで！
Dialogue: 9,0:12:29.73,0:12:32.56,Text - CN,Erika,0,0,0,,高台寺欧石楠  是大姐姐
Dialogue: 8,0:12:29.73,0:12:32.56,Text - JP,Erika,0,0,0,,高台寺えりかは　おねえちゃんよ
Dialogue: 9,0:12:32.56,0:12:35.15,Text - CN,Erika,0,0,0,,因为我最年长  所以是大姐姐
Dialogue: 8,0:12:32.56,0:12:35.15,Text - JP,Erika,0,0,0,,一番の年上だから　おねえちゃん
Dialogue: 9,0:12:35.15,0:12:37.07,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,大姐姐是什么职阶吗？
Dialogue: 8,0:12:35.15,0:12:37.07,Text - JP,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,おねえちゃんてクラスか？
Dialogue: 9,0:12:37.07,0:12:38.82,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,我叫雏芥子  叫我阿雏就行
Dialogue: 8,0:12:37.07,0:12:38.82,Text - JP,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,ひなげしは　ひなでいい
Dialogue: 9,0:12:41.91,0:12:43.99,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,我… 我…
Dialogue: 8,0:12:41.91,0:12:43.99,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,あ… 私…
Dialogue: 9,0:12:44.54,0:12:45.66,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,刚才真抱歉
Dialogue: 8,0:12:44.54,0:12:45.66,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,さっきはごめんね
Dialogue: 9,0:12:46.12,0:12:47.54,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,慢慢来就可以
Dialogue: 8,0:12:46.12,0:12:47.54,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,ゆっくりでいいし
Dialogue: 9,0:12:47.54,0:12:49.79,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,声音不大也没关系
Dialogue: 8,0:12:47.54,0:12:49.79,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,小さな声でも大丈夫だから
Dialogue: 9,0:12:50.17,0:12:52.92,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,我们会洗耳恭听的
Dialogue: 8,0:12:50.17,0:12:52.92,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,私たち　しっかり聞いてるから
Dialogue: 9,0:12:53.71,0:12:54.75,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,好  好！
Dialogue: 8,0:12:53.71,0:12:54.75,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,う　うん！
Dialogue: 9,0:12:55.13,0:12:57.72,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,初次见面  我叫莲华
Dialogue: 8,0:12:55.13,0:12:57.72,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,れんげっていいます　はじめまして
Dialogue: 9,0:12:57.72,0:12:58.63,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 8,0:12:57.72,0:12:58.63,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,うん
Dialogue: 9,0:12:58.63,0:13:00.05,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,初次见面  莲华
Dialogue: 8,0:12:58.63,0:13:00.05,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,はじめまして　れんげちゃん
Dialogue: 9,0:13:00.05,0:13:05.39,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,那个  在世界变成这样之后  我还是第一次见到其他人
Dialogue: 8,0:13:00.05,0:13:05.39,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,あ　あの　はじめてです　世界がこんなことになってから他の人と会ったの
Dialogue: 9,0:13:05.39,0:13:07.60,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,我们也蛮久没遇见过其他人了
Dialogue: 8,0:13:05.39,0:13:07.60,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,私たちもドンドン久しぶり
Dialogue: 9,0:13:07.60,0:13:08.85,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,就是啊
Dialogue: 8,0:13:07.60,0:13:08.85,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,それな
Dialogue: 9,0:13:08.85,0:13:11.27,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,在世界变得不得了之后就见不到人了
Dialogue: 8,0:13:08.85,0:13:11.27,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,マジヤバくなってから　人全然いねえし
Dialogue: 9,0:13:11.73,0:13:13.61,Text - CN,Erika,0,0,0,,莲华  你是从哪里来的？
Dialogue: 8,0:13:11.73,0:13:13.61,Text - JP,Erika,0,0,0,,れんげちゃん　どこから来たの？
Dialogue: 9,0:13:13.61,0:13:14.31,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 8,0:13:13.61,0:13:14.31,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,えっ？
Dialogue: 9,0:13:15.11,0:13:17.28,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,那个… 呃…
Dialogue: 8,0:13:15.11,0:13:17.28,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,えっと　あっ…
Dialogue: 9,0:13:20.11,0:13:21.45,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,别在意  别在意
Dialogue: 8,0:13:20.11,0:13:21.45,Text - JP,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,気にしない　気にしない
Dialogue: 9,0:13:21.45,0:13:24.12,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,雏芥子  这哪能不在意
Dialogue: 8,0:13:21.45,0:13:24.12,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,ひなげし　それは無理だろ
Dialogue: 9,0:13:24.66,0:13:26.70,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,那些东西  我们之后再向你解释
Dialogue: 8,0:13:24.66,0:13:26.70,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,これについては　あとで説明する
Dialogue: 9,0:13:26.70,0:13:29.50,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,不  不  没事  没事的
Dialogue: 8,0:13:26.70,0:13:29.50,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,い　いえ　大丈夫　大丈夫です
Dialogue: 9,0:13:29.91,0:13:31.17,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 8,0:13:29.91,0:13:31.17,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,よかった
Dialogue: 9,0:13:31.17,0:13:34.54,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,看见了那种东西  哪有没事的
Dialogue: 8,0:13:31.17,0:13:34.54,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,いや　あんなもの見たら　大丈夫じゃないだろう
Dialogue: 9,0:13:34.54,0:13:36.42,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,我不是那个意思
Dialogue: 8,0:13:34.54,0:13:36.42,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,そ　そうじゃないんです
Dialogue: 9,0:13:37.30,0:13:39.63,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,你们刚才是不是在吃饭？
Dialogue: 8,0:13:37.30,0:13:39.63,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,皆さん　ごはんの途中でした？
Dialogue: 9,0:13:40.26,0:13:43.30,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,非常抱歉  打扰你们吃饭了
Dialogue: 8,0:13:40.26,0:13:43.30,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,ごめんなさい　ごはんのおじゃましてしまいました
Dialogue: 9,0:13:43.64,0:13:44.93,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,不用在意
Dialogue: 8,0:13:43.64,0:13:44.93,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,気にしないで
Dialogue: 9,0:13:44.93,0:13:46.89,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,我们还没开始吃呢
Dialogue: 8,0:13:44.93,0:13:46.89,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,まだ食べ始めてなかったし
Dialogue: 9,0:13:46.89,0:13:49.14,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,都是罐头  所以也不会変冷
Dialogue: 8,0:13:46.89,0:13:49.14,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,缶詰だから　冷めちゃうわけでもないし
Dialogue: 9,0:13:49.14,0:13:50.06,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,就是说啦！
Dialogue: 8,0:13:49.14,0:13:50.06,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,それな！
Dialogue: 9,0:13:50.06,0:13:52.56,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,罐头虽好吃  但有点吃腻了
Dialogue: 8,0:13:50.06,0:13:52.56,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,缶詰マジおいしいけど　ちょっと飽きてんだよね
Dialogue: 9,0:13:52.56,0:13:56.69,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,冷冻食品在停电的时候就全坏掉了
Dialogue: 8,0:13:52.56,0:13:56.69,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,冷凍食品は停電していた頃にダメになっているからな
Dialogue: 9,0:13:56.69,0:14:00.15,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,料理包也很少见啊
Dialogue: 8,0:13:56.69,0:14:00.15,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,レトルトのパックも　ほとんど見つかんないんだよね
Dialogue: 9,0:14:00.15,0:14:01.03,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,割烹…
Dialogue: 8,0:14:00.15,0:14:01.03,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,割烹…
Dialogue: 9,0:14:01.03,0:14:01.74,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,莲华？
Dialogue: 8,0:14:01.03,0:14:01.74,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,れんげちゃん？
Dialogue: 9,0:14:01.74,0:14:02.82,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,割烹！
Dialogue: 8,0:14:01.74,0:14:02.82,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,割烹！
Dialogue: 9,0:14:03.53,0:14:05.74,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,莲华  太近了
Dialogue: 8,0:14:03.53,0:14:05.74,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,れんげちゃん　ドンドン近い
Dialogue: 9,0:14:05.74,0:14:08.24,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,你们最近基本都是吃罐头食品吧？
Dialogue: 8,0:14:05.74,0:14:08.24,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,最近のごはん　ほとんど缶詰ですね？
Dialogue: 9,0:14:08.99,0:14:12.62,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,除了罐头  我估计就只有泡面和偶尔的白饭
Dialogue: 8,0:14:08.99,0:14:12.62,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,あとはたぶん　インスタントのラーメンとか　ときどきお米
Dialogue: 9,0:14:12.62,0:14:14.00,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,好厉害  猜中了
Dialogue: 8,0:14:12.62,0:14:14.00,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,すごい正解
Dialogue: 9,0:14:14.37,0:14:16.96,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,罐头和泡面都很好吃
Dialogue: 8,0:14:14.37,0:14:16.96,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,缶詰もインスタントのラーメンもおいしいです
Dialogue: 9,0:14:16.96,0:14:19.09,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,可以吃上一辈子
Dialogue: 8,0:14:16.96,0:14:19.09,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,それだけずっと食べてもいいんです
Dialogue: 9,0:14:19.42,0:14:20.76,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,我想吃…
Dialogue: 8,0:14:19.42,0:14:20.76,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,食べたい…
Dialogue: 9,0:14:21.88,0:14:23.26,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,好大声啊！
Dialogue: 8,0:14:21.88,0:14:23.26,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,おっきい～！
Dialogue: 9,0:14:23.26,0:14:24.97,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,你是真饿了吧
Dialogue: 8,0:14:23.26,0:14:24.97,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,マジおなか減ってんじゃん
Dialogue: 9,0:14:25.30,0:14:27.39,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,但是  只要稍微割烹一下
Dialogue: 8,0:14:25.30,0:14:27.39,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,でも　ちょっと割烹すると
Dialogue: 9,0:14:27.39,0:14:30.60,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,就能做出好吃又有营养的饭菜！
Dialogue: 8,0:14:27.39,0:14:30.60,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,おいしくて栄養ももっといっぱいの料理にできるんです！
Dialogue: 9,0:14:30.93,0:14:32.18,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,割嘭？
Dialogue: 8,0:14:30.93,0:14:32.18,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,カッポー？
Dialogue: 9,0:14:32.18,0:14:33.52,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,是「割烹」吧
Dialogue: 8,0:14:32.18,0:14:33.52,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,割烹だろ
Comment: 9,0:14:33.52,0:14:36.19,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,(在词典中就是「烹饪食物」的意思,※现在一般指一种日本传统烹饪方式)
Dialogue: 9,0:14:33.52,0:14:36.19,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,在词典中就是「烹饪食物」的意思
Dialogue: 9,0:14:33.52,0:14:36.19,RUBY,Ayame,0,0,0,,{\fs40\pos(960,965)}※现在一般指一种日本传统烹饪方式
Dialogue: 8,0:14:33.52,0:14:36.19,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,辞書そのままの意味は　「食物の調理」だ
Dialogue: 9,0:14:36.19,0:14:39.07,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,班长  你把词典背下来了吗？
Dialogue: 8,0:14:36.19,0:14:39.07,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,委員長　辞書暗記してんの？
Dialogue: 9,0:14:39.07,0:14:40.69,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,真是笑死！
Dialogue: 8,0:14:39.07,0:14:40.69,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,マジで草生える！
Dialogue: 9,0:14:42.11,0:14:44.66,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,废墟三分钟割烹！
Dialogue: 8,0:14:42.11,0:14:44.66,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,廃墟 3 分かっぽ～！
Dialogue: 9,0:14:44.66,0:14:46.20,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,你这是刚想出来的吧
Dialogue: 8,0:14:44.66,0:14:46.20,Text - JP,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,今　思いついたな
Dialogue: 9,0:14:46.53,0:14:48.87,Text - CN,Erika,0,0,0,,大姐姐我觉得不错
Dialogue: 8,0:14:46.53,0:14:48.87,Text - JP,Erika,0,0,0,,おねえちゃん　いいわよ　いいわよ
Dialogue: 9,0:14:48.87,0:14:50.12,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,刚想到的！
Dialogue: 8,0:14:48.87,0:14:50.12,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,今思いついた
Dialogue: 9,0:14:50.12,0:14:51.95,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,废墟三分钟割烹！
Dialogue: 8,0:14:50.12,0:14:51.95,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,廃墟 3 分かっぽ～！
Dialogue: 9,0:14:51.95,0:14:54.00,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,感觉像是美食节目一样呢
Dialogue: 8,0:14:51.95,0:14:54.00,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,コーナーみたいになってきたね
Dialogue: 9,0:14:54.00,0:14:55.37,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,就当做美食节目吧！
Dialogue: 8,0:14:54.00,0:14:55.37,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,コーナーでいきます！
Dialogue: 9,0:14:55.37,0:14:56.25,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,割烹！
Dialogue: 8,0:14:55.37,0:14:56.25,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,割烹！
Dialogue: 9,0:14:56.25,0:14:57.33,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,割烹！
Dialogue: 8,0:14:56.25,0:14:57.33,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,カッポー！
Dialogue: 9,0:14:57.33,0:14:58.88,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,这是什么口号吗？
Dialogue: 8,0:14:57.33,0:14:58.88,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,かけ声なのか？
Dialogue: 9,0:14:58.88,0:14:59.71,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,来咯！
Dialogue: 8,0:14:58.88,0:14:59.71,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,ガチあげ！
Dialogue: 9,0:14:59.71,0:15:02.46,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,废墟三分钟简单割烹！
Dialogue: 8,0:14:59.71,0:15:02.46,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,廃墟 3 分簡単かっぽ～！
Dialogue: 9,0:15:02.46,0:15:04.76,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,要准备的食材请看这里
Dialogue: 8,0:15:02.46,0:15:04.76,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,用意するものはこちらになります
Dialogue: 9,0:15:05.26,0:15:08.35,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,这次我们用泡水就能煮熟的方便米饭
Dialogue: 8,0:15:05.26,0:15:08.35,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,今回はお湯で戻せる　アルファ化米を使いますね
Dialogue: 9,0:15:08.72,0:15:11.56,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,用大家手里有的东西做食材
Dialogue: 8,0:15:08.72,0:15:11.56,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,食材は皆さんの持ってるものを　いただきました
Dialogue: 9,0:15:11.56,0:15:12.72,Text - CN,Erika,0,0,0,,好哦  好哦！
Dialogue: 8,0:15:11.56,0:15:12.72,Text - JP,Erika,0,0,0,,いいわよ　いいわよ！
Dialogue: 9,0:15:13.43,0:15:16.06,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,把蒲烧秋刀鱼放在米饭上
Dialogue: 8,0:15:13.43,0:15:16.06,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,ごはんの上に　さんまのかば焼きをのせます
Dialogue: 9,0:15:16.06,0:15:17.90,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,再盖上盖子闷一段时间
Dialogue: 8,0:15:16.06,0:15:17.90,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,あとは蓋をして放置
Dialogue: 9,0:15:18.31,0:15:21.69,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,同时把冻干青葱用水煮还原
Dialogue: 8,0:15:18.31,0:15:21.69,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,この間にフリーズドライのわけぎを　お湯で戻しておきます
Dialogue: 9,0:15:22.28,0:15:26.41,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,把还原的青葱  海苔丝  青芥末加上去  就做好了！
Dialogue: 8,0:15:22.28,0:15:26.41,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,戻したわけぎ　きざみのり　わさびをのせて　できあがり！
Dialogue: 9,0:15:27.07,0:15:28.74,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,三分钟早就过了
Dialogue: 8,0:15:27.07,0:15:28.74,Text - JP,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,3 分過ぎてる
Dialogue: 9,0:15:28.74,0:15:30.41,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,十分钟割烹！
Dialogue: 8,0:15:28.74,0:15:30.41,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,10 分かっぽ～！
Dialogue: 9,0:15:30.41,0:15:32.74,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,罐装蒲烧秋刀鱼盖饭三吃
Dialogue: 8,0:15:30.41,0:15:32.74,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,さんまのかば焼き缶のひつまぶし！
Dialogue: 9,0:15:32.74,0:15:33.45,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,强行圆啊！
Dialogue: 8,0:15:32.74,0:15:33.45,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,強引！
Dialogue: 9,0:15:33.83,0:15:35.29,Text - CN,Renge,0,1000,0,,今天再来一道菜
Dialogue: 8,0:15:33.83,0:15:35.29,Text - JP,Renge,0,1000,0,,今日はもう一品
Dialogue: 9,0:15:35.71,0:15:39.13,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,先把冻干的根菜用水煮还原
Dialogue: 8,0:15:35.71,0:15:39.13,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,まず　フリーズドライの根菜をお湯で戻します
Dialogue: 9,0:15:38.17,0:15:39.84,Text - CN - top,Yuri,0,0,0,,真方便啊
Dialogue: 8,0:15:38.17,0:15:39.84,Text - JP - top,Yuri,0,0,0,,ホント便利！
Dialogue: 9,0:15:39.84,0:15:43.59,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,加热芝麻油  用小火翻炒根菜
Dialogue: 8,0:15:39.84,0:15:43.59,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,ゴマ油を熱して　根菜を弱火で炒めます
Dialogue: 9,0:15:43.59,0:15:45.97,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,然后再把秋刀鱼去骨和酱汁一起倒进去
Dialogue: 8,0:15:43.59,0:15:45.97,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,それから身をほぐして　汁ごと加える
Dialogue: 9,0:15:47.18,0:15:49.47,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,等全部加热之后就做好了！
Dialogue: 8,0:15:47.18,0:15:49.47,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,火が通ったら完成！
Dialogue: 9,0:15:49.80,0:15:51.56,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,秋刀鱼金平牛蒡！
Dialogue: 8,0:15:49.80,0:15:51.56,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,秋刀魚きんぴら！
Dialogue: 9,0:15:52.06,0:15:54.10,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,请大家按照自己的口味调味
Dialogue: 8,0:15:52.06,0:15:54.10,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,お好きな味に調整してください
Dialogue: 9,0:15:59.40,0:16:01.44,Text - CN,All,0,0,0,,我开动了！
Dialogue: 8,0:15:59.40,0:16:01.44,Text - JP,All,0,0,0,,いただきます！
Dialogue: 9,0:16:01.44,0:16:02.69,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,真热乎！
Dialogue: 8,0:16:01.44,0:16:02.69,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,あったかい！
Dialogue: 9,0:16:02.69,0:16:04.65,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,酱汁的味道浸入了米饭中
Dialogue: 8,0:16:02.69,0:16:04.65,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,ごはんにタレが染みてるよ
Dialogue: 9,0:16:04.65,0:16:07.07,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,葱原来这么香啊
Dialogue: 8,0:16:04.65,0:16:07.07,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,わけぎって　こんなにいい匂いするんだ
Dialogue: 9,0:16:05.57,0:16:09.57,Text - CN - top,Renge,0,0,0,,稍微花功夫割烹一下  饭菜的味道就会截然不同
Dialogue: 8,0:16:05.57,0:16:09.57,Text - JP - top,Renge,0,0,0,,ちょっと割烹するだけで　ごはんってすっごく変わるんです
Comment: 9,0:16:10.53,0:16:12.70,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,(虽是盖饭三吃用的却不是鳗鱼,※通常来说ひつまぶし是用鳗鱼做的鳗鱼饭三吃)
Dialogue: 9,0:16:10.53,0:16:12.70,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,虽是盖饭三吃用的却不是鳗鱼
Dialogue: 9,0:16:10.53,0:16:12.70,RUBY,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,{\fs40\pos(960,965)}※通常来说ひつまぶし是用鳗鱼做的鳗鱼饭三吃
Dialogue: 8,0:16:10.53,0:16:12.70,Text - JP,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,うなぎじゃないけど　ひつまぶし
Dialogue: 9,0:16:12.70,0:16:13.70,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,鳗鱼皮肤{秋刀鱼的皮肤？网游意义上的皮肤？}
Dialogue: 8,0:16:12.70,0:16:13.70,Text - JP,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,うなぎスキン
Dialogue: 9,0:16:14.49,0:16:16.25,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,好久没吃过蔬菜了
Dialogue: 8,0:16:14.49,0:16:16.25,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,久しぶりの野菜だな
Dialogue: 9,0:16:16.54,0:16:19.37,Text - CN,Erika,0,0,0,,光靠罐头里的酱汁和砂糖酱油
Dialogue: 8,0:16:16.54,0:16:19.37,Text - JP,Erika,0,0,0,,缶詰のお汁と砂糖醤油だけで
Dialogue: 9,0:16:19.37,0:16:21.75,Text - CN,Erika,0,0,0,,就能做出这么好吃的味道啊
Dialogue: 8,0:16:19.37,0:16:21.75,Text - JP,Erika,0,0,0,,こんなにいいお味がつくのね
Dialogue: 9,0:16:21.75,0:16:25.84,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,这里面的膳食纤维多得不得了  对身体来说也是不得了
Dialogue: 8,0:16:21.75,0:16:25.84,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,ヤバいくらい　食物繊維入ってるから体にマジヤバいし
Dialogue: 9,0:16:24.71,0:16:25.84,Text - CN - top,Ayame,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 8,0:16:24.71,0:16:25.84,Text - JP - top,Ayame,0,0,0,,なに!?
Dialogue: 9,0:16:26.17,0:16:28.80,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,你的意思是这对身体好吗？
Dialogue: 8,0:16:26.17,0:16:28.80,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,それは体にいいということか？
Dialogue: 9,0:16:28.80,0:16:32.22,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,胡萝卜富含的 β-胡萝卜素对皮肤有益
Dialogue: 8,0:16:28.80,0:16:32.22,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,ニンジンに含まれているベータカロチンはお肌によくて
Dialogue: 9,0:16:32.22,0:16:33.72,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,还能预防感冒
Dialogue: 8,0:16:32.22,0:16:33.72,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,風邪も防止します
Dialogue: 9,0:16:33.26,0:16:34.81,Text - CN - top,Sazanka,0,0,0,,什么？能护肤？
Dialogue: 8,0:16:33.26,0:16:34.81,Text - JP - top,Sazanka,0,0,0,,てかスキン・ケア？
Dialogue: 9,0:16:34.81,0:16:35.97,Text - CN - top,Sazanka,0,0,0,,不得了  真不得了
Dialogue: 8,0:16:34.81,0:16:35.97,Text - JP - top,Sazanka,0,0,0,,ヤバ　マジやばいジャン
Dialogue: 9,0:16:36.39,0:16:39.02,Text - CN,Erika,0,0,0,,现在一个小感冒就可能会要人命
Dialogue: 8,0:16:36.39,0:16:39.02,Text - JP,Erika,0,0,0,,今は風邪が命にかかわるから
Dialogue: 9,0:16:39.02,0:16:40.23,Text - CN,Erika,0,0,0,,大姐姐我好高兴
Dialogue: 8,0:16:39.02,0:16:40.23,Text - JP,Erika,0,0,0,,おねえちゃんうれしい
Dialogue: 9,0:16:42.31,0:16:43.69,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 8,0:16:42.31,0:16:43.69,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,どうしたの？
Dialogue: 9,0:16:43.69,0:16:44.90,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,这是茶
Dialogue: 8,0:16:43.69,0:16:44.90,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,これはお茶です
Dialogue: 9,0:16:45.28,0:16:48.07,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,说到盖饭三吃的话就是要做成茶泡饭
Dialogue: 8,0:16:45.28,0:16:48.07,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,ひつまぶしといえば　お茶をいれて味変
Dialogue: 9,0:16:49.82,0:16:51.57,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,转职吗？
Dialogue: 8,0:16:49.82,0:16:51.57,Text - JP,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,クラス・チェンジか？
Dialogue: 9,0:16:52.07,0:16:53.99,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,那我们也来加茶吧！
Dialogue: 8,0:16:52.07,0:16:53.99,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,ドンドンドーンっとやってみよう！
Dialogue: 9,0:16:54.70,0:16:57.33,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,这菜色的变化蛮大啊
Dialogue: 8,0:16:54.70,0:16:57.33,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,こっちもドンドン変わるんだね
Dialogue: 9,0:16:57.62,0:17:01.00,Text - CN,Erika,0,0,0,,你这段时间都没吃多少饭
Dialogue: 8,0:16:57.62,0:17:01.00,Text - JP,Erika,0,0,0,,ゆりちゃん　最近あまり食べてなかったのに
Dialogue: 9,0:17:01.00,0:17:02.13,Text - CN,Erika,0,0,0,,真是太好了
Dialogue: 8,0:17:01.00,0:17:02.13,Text - JP,Erika,0,0,0,,よかった
Dialogue: 9,0:17:02.13,0:17:03.04,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,真是这样
Dialogue: 8,0:17:02.13,0:17:03.04,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,ホントだ
Dialogue: 9,0:17:06.30,0:17:07.71,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,怎  怎么了？
Dialogue: 8,0:17:06.30,0:17:07.71,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,どうした？
Dialogue: 9,0:17:08.34,0:17:11.93,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,青  青芥末  放太多了…
Dialogue: 8,0:17:08.34,0:17:11.93,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,わ　わさび　いっぱい入った…
Dialogue: 9,0:17:11.93,0:17:13.05,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,有罪
Dialogue: 8,0:17:11.93,0:17:13.05,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,ギルティだ
Dialogue: 9,0:17:13.39,0:17:15.76,Text - CN,All,0,0,0,,多谢款待！
Dialogue: 8,0:17:13.39,0:17:15.76,Text - JP,All,0,0,0,,ごちそうさまでした！
Comment: 9,0:17:16.22,0:17:18.31,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,(真是「珍味佳肴」啊,※日语中算是生僻词，所以雏芥子没听懂)
Dialogue: 9,0:17:16.22,0:17:18.31,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,真是「珍味佳肴」啊
Dialogue: 9,0:17:16.22,0:17:18.31,RUBY,Sazanka,0,0,0,,{\fs40\pos(960,965)}※日语中算是生僻词，所以雏芥子没听懂
Dialogue: 8,0:17:16.22,0:17:18.31,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,マジ珍味佳肴だったから
Dialogue: 9,0:17:18.31,0:17:20.06,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,吃了一碗又一碗
Dialogue: 8,0:17:18.31,0:17:20.06,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,すげぇおかわりしたし
Dialogue: 9,0:17:20.06,0:17:21.56,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,真是… 什么？
Dialogue: 8,0:17:20.06,0:17:21.56,Text - JP,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,マジ… なに？
Dialogue: 9,0:17:21.81,0:17:24.65,Text - CN,Erika,0,0,0,,莲华  你真厉害啊
Dialogue: 8,0:17:21.81,0:17:24.65,Text - JP,Erika,0,0,0,,それにしても　れんげちゃんってすごいわね
Dialogue: 9,0:17:24.65,0:17:27.15,Text - CN,Erika,0,0,0,,这么短的时间就做出了美味的饭菜…
Dialogue: 8,0:17:24.65,0:17:27.15,Text - JP,Erika,0,0,0,,こんな短時間でおいしいごはん…
Dialogue: 9,0:17:31.32,0:17:33.03,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,我  我…
Dialogue: 8,0:17:31.32,0:17:33.03,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,わ　私…
Dialogue: 9,0:17:33.37,0:17:34.70,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 8,0:17:33.37,0:17:34.70,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,どうしたの？
Dialogue: 9,0:17:34.70,0:17:36.03,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,吃太多了？
Dialogue: 8,0:17:34.70,0:17:36.03,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,食べすぎちゃった？
Dialogue: 9,0:17:36.03,0:17:37.45,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,对  对不起！
Dialogue: 8,0:17:36.03,0:17:37.45,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,ご　ごめんなさい！
Dialogue: 9,0:17:37.91,0:17:40.29,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,明明只是我想吃东西而已
Dialogue: 8,0:17:37.91,0:17:40.29,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,私が食べたかっただけなのに
Dialogue: 9,0:17:40.29,0:17:41.46,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,却在冲动之下
Dialogue: 8,0:17:40.29,0:17:41.46,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,つい勢いで
Dialogue: 9,0:17:41.46,0:17:44.21,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,搞成了割烹节目
Dialogue: 8,0:17:41.46,0:17:44.21,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,割烹コーナーみたいなことしちゃった
Dialogue: 9,0:17:44.21,0:17:45.21,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,莲华！
Dialogue: 8,0:17:44.21,0:17:45.21,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,れんげちゃん！
Dialogue: 9,0:17:45.21,0:17:45.79,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,到
Dialogue: 8,0:17:45.21,0:17:45.79,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,はい
Dialogue: 9,0:17:45.79,0:17:48.55,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,你的饭菜真的让我很开心！
Dialogue: 8,0:17:45.79,0:17:48.55,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,ほんとうに　ごはんうれしかった！
Dialogue: 9,0:17:49.05,0:17:53.39,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,这是我这段时间吃得最多  笑得最多的一次
Dialogue: 8,0:17:49.05,0:17:53.39,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,私　最近で一番たくさん食べたし　一番笑ったと思う
Dialogue: 9,0:17:53.68,0:17:56.56,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,所以我想谢谢你
Dialogue: 8,0:17:53.68,0:17:56.56,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,だからね　ありがとうって言いたいの
Dialogue: 9,0:17:57.93,0:17:59.22,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,平复下来了吗？
Dialogue: 8,0:17:57.93,0:17:59.22,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,落ち着いた？
Dialogue: 9,0:17:59.22,0:18:00.35,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 8,0:17:59.22,0:18:00.35,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,はい
Dialogue: 9,0:18:00.93,0:18:04.35,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,其实  我非常喜欢吃东西
Dialogue: 8,0:18:00.93,0:18:04.35,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,実は私　食べるのがすっごく好きで
Dialogue: 9,0:18:04.35,0:18:07.36,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,我看得出来  你非常爱吃
Dialogue: 8,0:18:04.35,0:18:07.36,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,わかる　れんげちゃんが　食べるの好きなの
Dialogue: 9,0:18:07.36,0:18:09.19,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,这根本不是秘密好吧
Dialogue: 8,0:18:07.36,0:18:09.19,Text - JP,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,実は… じゃねえよ
Dialogue: 9,0:18:09.19,0:18:10.11,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 8,0:18:09.19,0:18:10.11,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,よし
Dialogue: 9,0:18:10.11,0:18:10.99,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,咳咳！
Dialogue: 8,0:18:10.11,0:18:10.99,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,オホン！
Dialogue: 9,0:18:10.99,0:18:13.66,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,我们说回正题…
Dialogue: 8,0:18:10.99,0:18:13.66,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,それでだ　話しそびれていたが…
Dialogue: 9,0:18:14.74,0:18:16.53,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,关于那些…
Dialogue: 8,0:18:14.74,0:18:16.53,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,あっ　そのことなんですけど…
Dialogue: 9,0:18:16.53,0:18:17.78,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,报警!
Dialogue: 8,0:18:16.53,0:18:17.78,Text - JP,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,通報！
Dialogue: 9,0:18:17.78,0:18:19.16,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,才不会
Dialogue: 8,0:18:17.78,0:18:19.16,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,されない
Dialogue: 9,0:18:19.16,0:18:20.58,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,我来解释
Dialogue: 8,0:18:19.16,0:18:20.58,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,説明させてもらう
Dialogue: 9,0:18:21.08,0:18:22.54,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,小鸢  等一下
Dialogue: 8,0:18:21.08,0:18:22.54,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,あやちゃん待って
Dialogue: 9,0:18:26.79,0:18:28.05,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,等  等一下！
Dialogue: 8,0:18:26.79,0:18:28.05,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,ま　待って！
Dialogue: 9,0:18:30.63,0:18:31.42,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,那个！
Dialogue: 8,0:18:30.63,0:18:31.42,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,あの！
Dialogue: 9,0:18:31.42,0:18:33.43,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,不可以！莲华  你不可以跟上来
Dialogue: 8,0:18:31.42,0:18:33.43,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,ダメ　れんげちゃん　来ちゃダメ
Dialogue: 9,0:18:33.43,0:18:35.93,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,抱歉  我本该做好侦察的
Dialogue: 8,0:18:33.43,0:18:35.93,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,すまない　偵察しておくべきだった
Dialogue: 9,0:18:35.93,0:18:38.64,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,那是我的工作  抱歉！
Dialogue: 8,0:18:35.93,0:18:38.64,Text - JP,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,それは　ひなの仕事　ごめん！
Dialogue: 9,0:18:42.73,0:18:44.19,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,有两个
Dialogue: 8,0:18:42.73,0:18:44.19,Text - JP,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,2 体いる
Dialogue: 9,0:18:45.52,0:18:47.44,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,没法一口气全部干掉
Dialogue: 8,0:18:45.52,0:18:47.44,Text - JP,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,ワンパンキルは無理！
Dialogue: 9,0:18:47.77,0:18:49.19,Text - CN,Erika,0,0,0,,交给大姐姐吧
Dialogue: 8,0:18:47.77,0:18:49.19,Text - JP,Erika,0,0,0,,おねえちゃんに任せて
Dialogue: 9,0:18:49.48,0:18:51.07,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,莲华  退下
Dialogue: 8,0:18:49.48,0:18:51.07,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,れんげちゃん下がって
Comment: 9,0:18:51.07,0:18:54.07,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,我们把它们叫做(狂猎,Wild Hunt)
Dialogue: 9,0:18:51.07,0:18:54.07,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,我们把它们叫做狂猎
Dialogue: 9,0:18:51.07,0:18:54.07,RUBY,Ayame,0,0,0,,{\fs40\pos(1153,965)}Wild Hunt
Dialogue: 8,0:18:51.07,0:18:54.07,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,自分たちはアイツらをワイルドハントと呼んでいる
Dialogue: 9,0:18:54.07,0:18:57.07,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,一般的人类只要接近它们就会被消灭
Dialogue: 8,0:18:54.07,0:18:57.07,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,普通の人間は近づくだけで消されてしまう
Dialogue: 9,0:18:57.07,0:18:59.33,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,不要担心我们
Dialogue: 8,0:18:57.07,0:18:59.33,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,私たちのことは心配しないで
Dialogue: 9,0:19:00.16,0:19:02.33,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,我把刚才的武器放在这里
Dialogue: 8,0:19:00.16,0:19:02.33,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,さっきの武器立てとくし
Dialogue: 9,0:19:02.87,0:19:05.71,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,这个武器能防御住消除人类的力量
Dialogue: 8,0:19:02.87,0:19:05.71,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,人間を消す力に対して盾になる
Dialogue: 9,0:19:05.71,0:19:06.83,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,躲到它后面
Dialogue: 8,0:19:05.71,0:19:06.83,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,その後ろにいてくれ
Comment: 9,0:19:09.71,0:19:11.76,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,(安德瓦里,Andvari)  展开！
Dialogue: 9,0:19:09.71,0:19:11.76,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,安德瓦里  展开！
Dialogue: 9,0:19:09.71,0:19:11.76,RUBY,Yuri,0,0,0,,{\fs40\pos(864,965)}Andvari
Dialogue: 8,0:19:09.71,0:19:11.76,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,アンドヴァリ・エクステンド！
Dialogue: 9,0:19:15.30,0:19:16.22,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,不用担心
Dialogue: 8,0:19:15.30,0:19:16.22,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,大丈夫
Dialogue: 9,0:19:16.22,0:19:18.35,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,莲华  我们会保护你的
Dialogue: 8,0:19:16.22,0:19:18.35,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,れんげちゃんは　私たちが守るから
Dialogue: 9,0:19:18.80,0:19:21.10,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,好  那就气势满…
Dialogue: 8,0:19:18.80,0:19:21.10,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,よし　それじゃドンドン…
Dialogue: 9,0:19:21.10,0:19:22.06,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,莲华？
Dialogue: 8,0:19:21.10,0:19:22.06,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,れんげちゃん？
Dialogue: 9,0:19:22.35,0:19:25.06,Text - CN,Renge,0,600,0,,你已经感受到我的呼唤了吧
Dialogue: 9,0:19:22.35,0:19:24.27,Text - CN,Yuri,1300,0,0,,你在做什么…
Dialogue: 8,0:19:22.35,0:19:25.06,Text - JP,Renge,0,600,0,,れんげの思い　届いてるよね？
Dialogue: 8,0:19:22.35,0:19:24.27,Text - JP,Yuri,1300,0,0,,れんげちゃん　何を？
Dialogue: 9,0:19:25.48,0:19:26.31,Text - CN,Renge,0,600,0,,过来
Dialogue: 8,0:19:25.48,0:19:26.31,Text - JP,Renge,0,600,0,,来て
Dialogue: 9,0:19:46.25,0:19:47.92,Text - CN,Yuri,900,0,0,,莲华也有吗？
Dialogue: 8,0:19:46.25,0:19:47.92,Text - JP,Yuri,900,0,0,,れんげちゃんも持ってるの？
Dialogue: 9,0:19:46.54,0:19:47.50,Text - CN,Erika,0,800,0,,飞起来了
Dialogue: 8,0:19:46.54,0:19:47.50,Text - JP,Erika,0,800,0,,飛んだ
Dialogue: 9,0:19:46.54,0:19:47.92,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,真不得了
Dialogue: 8,0:19:46.54,0:19:47.92,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,ホントにやばい
Dialogue: 9,0:19:51.04,0:19:52.00,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,上吧
Dialogue: 8,0:19:51.04,0:19:52.00,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,行こう
Dialogue: 9,0:19:54.67,0:19:56.80,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,我能遇见到大家非常高兴
Dialogue: 8,0:19:54.67,0:19:56.80,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,みんなに会えてうれしかった
Dialogue: 9,0:19:56.80,0:19:59.47,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,所以我会努力的！
Dialogue: 8,0:19:56.80,0:19:59.47,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,だから　れんげが頑張ります！
Dialogue: 9,0:20:13.73,0:20:15.15,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,秒  秒杀？
Dialogue: 8,0:20:13.73,0:20:15.15,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,しゅ　瞬殺！
Dialogue: 9,0:20:15.15,0:20:16.53,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,惊人的破坏力
Dialogue: 8,0:20:15.15,0:20:16.53,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,なんて破壊力だ
Dialogue: 9,0:20:16.53,0:20:17.24,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,开挂了
Dialogue: 8,0:20:16.53,0:20:17.24,Text - JP,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,チート
Dialogue: 9,0:20:27.41,0:20:29.29,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,不  不要误会
Dialogue: 8,0:20:27.41,0:20:29.29,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,ここ　これは違うんです
Dialogue: 9,0:20:30.71,0:20:32.88,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,我不是在隐瞒武器的事
Dialogue: 8,0:20:30.71,0:20:32.88,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,武器持ってたの　黙ってたんじゃなくて
Dialogue: 9,0:20:32.88,0:20:34.71,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,我是做饭做得太投入
Dialogue: 8,0:20:32.88,0:20:34.71,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,ごはんに夢中で　うっかりしちゃって
Dialogue: 9,0:20:34.71,0:20:36.09,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,而且它能自己飞过来
Dialogue: 8,0:20:34.71,0:20:36.09,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,自分で飛んでくれるから　そのへんに
Dialogue: 9,0:20:36.09,0:20:37.92,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,我就把它放在那边了
Dialogue: 8,0:20:36.09,0:20:37.92,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,置いてることもあって
Dialogue: 9,0:20:37.92,0:20:39.30,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,莲华！
Dialogue: 8,0:20:37.92,0:20:39.30,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,れんげちゃん！
Dialogue: 9,0:20:39.59,0:20:41.01,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,你真厉害！
Dialogue: 8,0:20:39.59,0:20:41.01,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,すごいね！
Dialogue: 9,0:20:41.60,0:20:43.56,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,没  没有啦
Dialogue: 8,0:20:41.60,0:20:43.56,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,そ　そんなことないです
Dialogue: 9,0:20:43.56,0:20:45.72,Text - CN - top,Yuri,0,0,0,,你真的很厉害  莲华！
Dialogue: 8,0:20:43.56,0:20:45.72,Text - JP - top,Yuri,0,0,0,,ホントすごい　れんげちゃん！
Dialogue: 9,0:20:43.93,0:20:46.48,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,你和我们一样啊
Dialogue: 8,0:20:43.93,0:20:46.48,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,君も自分たちと同じだったんだな
Dialogue: 9,0:20:46.48,0:20:48.60,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,你也取得了掉落的武器
Dialogue: 8,0:20:46.48,0:20:48.60,Text - JP,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,ドロップした武器手に入れたヤツ
Dialogue: 9,0:20:48.94,0:20:50.65,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,是吗？
Dialogue: 8,0:20:48.94,0:20:50.65,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,そうなんですか？
Dialogue: 9,0:20:50.65,0:20:51.56,Text - CN,Erika,0,0,0,,对啊
Dialogue: 8,0:20:50.65,0:20:51.56,Text - JP,Erika,0,0,0,,そうなの
Dialogue: 9,0:20:51.56,0:20:53.52,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,等一下  你是什么意思？
Dialogue: 8,0:20:51.56,0:20:53.52,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,待て　それはどういうことだ？
Comment: 9,0:20:53.98,0:20:58.03,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,你的武器不是那些(狂猎,Wild Hunt)身上掉落来的吗？
Dialogue: 9,0:20:53.98,0:20:58.03,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,你的武器不是那些狂猎身上掉落来的吗？
Dialogue: 9,0:20:53.98,0:20:58.03,RUBY,Ayame,0,0,0,,{\fs40\pos(960,965)}Wild Hunt
Dialogue: 8,0:20:53.98,0:20:58.03,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,その武器は　アイツらワイルドハントから手に入れたものじゃ　ないのか？
Comment: 9,0:20:58.61,0:21:00.78,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,我们把武器叫做(安德瓦里,Andvari)
Dialogue: 9,0:20:58.61,0:21:00.78,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,我们把武器叫做安德瓦里
Dialogue: 9,0:20:58.61,0:21:00.78,RUBY,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,{\fs40\pos(1153,965)}Andvari
Dialogue: 8,0:20:58.61,0:21:00.78,Text - JP,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,武器は　アンドヴァリってよんでる
Comment: 9,0:21:00.78,0:21:02.87,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,你的(安德瓦里,Andvari)不是掉落的吗？
Dialogue: 9,0:21:00.78,0:21:02.87,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,你的安德瓦里不是掉落的吗？
Dialogue: 9,0:21:00.78,0:21:02.87,RUBY,Ayame,0,0,0,,{\fs40\pos(821,965)}Andvari
Dialogue: 8,0:21:00.78,0:21:02.87,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,君のアンドヴァリは違うのか？
Dialogue: 9,0:21:02.87,0:21:04.74,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,我  我不知道
Dialogue: 8,0:21:02.87,0:21:04.74,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,わからないんです
Dialogue: 9,0:21:05.74,0:21:08.33,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,我没有记忆
Dialogue: 8,0:21:05.74,0:21:08.33,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,私　記憶がないんです
Dialogue: 9,0:21:08.33,0:21:11.50,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,我一开始就有这把武器了
Dialogue: 8,0:21:08.33,0:21:11.50,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,この武器を　気づくと持ってて
Dialogue: 9,0:21:13.71,0:21:15.55,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,你们都有过去的记忆吗？
Dialogue: 8,0:21:13.71,0:21:15.55,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,皆さん　記憶あるんですか？
Dialogue: 9,0:21:15.55,0:21:17.17,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,我有
Dialogue: 8,0:21:15.55,0:21:17.17,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,私はあるかな
Dialogue: 9,0:21:17.17,0:21:17.96,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,有
Dialogue: 8,0:21:17.17,0:21:17.96,Text - JP,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,ある
Dialogue: 9,0:21:17.96,0:21:21.55,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,话说我常去的美容沙龙没了  可伤心了
Dialogue: 8,0:21:17.96,0:21:21.55,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,ってか行きつけの美容室なくなったの　マジつらたん
Dialogue: 9,0:21:21.55,0:21:25.64,Text - CN,Erika,0,0,0,,我从奶奶那继承来的 708 条大姐姐的人生智慧
Dialogue: 8,0:21:21.55,0:21:25.64,Text - JP,Erika,0,0,0,,おばあちゃんから受け継いだ七百八のおねえちゃんの知恵袋
Dialogue: 9,0:21:25.64,0:21:27.02,Text - CN,Erika,0,0,0,,我全都记得
Dialogue: 8,0:21:25.64,0:21:27.02,Text - JP,Erika,0,0,0,,ちゃんと覚えてるわ
Dialogue: 9,0:21:27.02,0:21:30.02,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,我没能拿到手游的登录奖励
Dialogue: 8,0:21:27.02,0:21:30.02,Text - JP,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,ソシャゲのログボ回収できてない
Dialogue: 9,0:21:30.02,0:21:32.15,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,就只有我失去记忆了吗？
Dialogue: 8,0:21:30.02,0:21:32.15,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,記憶ないの私だけ!?
Dialogue: 9,0:21:32.44,0:21:34.40,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,但是你的厨艺了得啊
Dialogue: 8,0:21:32.44,0:21:34.40,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,でも　割烹すごかったよ
Dialogue: 9,0:21:34.40,0:21:35.77,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,那不是你的记忆吗？
Dialogue: 8,0:21:34.40,0:21:35.77,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,それって記憶じゃないの？
Dialogue: 9,0:21:36.02,0:21:37.73,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,很多时候就算失去记忆
Dialogue: 8,0:21:36.02,0:21:37.73,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,記憶を失っても
Dialogue: 9,0:21:37.73,0:21:40.15,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,也不会忘记自己的熟练技能
Dialogue: 8,0:21:37.73,0:21:40.15,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,手慣れたことはできることがある
Dialogue: 9,0:21:40.15,0:21:42.66,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,大部分情况下  人都不会忘记如何走路
Dialogue: 8,0:21:40.15,0:21:42.66,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,多くの場合は　歩き方を忘れることはない
Dialogue: 9,0:21:43.70,0:21:44.99,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,原来如此！
Dialogue: 8,0:21:43.70,0:21:44.99,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,なるほど！
Dialogue: 9,0:21:44.99,0:21:48.79,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,对莲华来说  割烹就像是走路一样呢
Dialogue: 8,0:21:44.99,0:21:48.79,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,れんげちゃんの割烹は　歩き方と同じなんだね
Dialogue: 9,0:21:48.79,0:21:50.29,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,是吗？
Dialogue: 8,0:21:48.79,0:21:50.29,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,そうなんでしょうか？
Dialogue: 9,0:21:50.91,0:21:54.21,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,那你就真的是受了很多苦啊
Dialogue: 8,0:21:50.91,0:21:54.21,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,でも　それなら　本当に大変だったよね
Dialogue: 9,0:21:55.38,0:21:57.88,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,就算实力强大  厨艺高超
Dialogue: 8,0:21:55.38,0:21:57.88,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,強くても　料理ができても
Dialogue: 9,0:21:57.88,0:22:00.47,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,但是却什么都不记得  一直都是孤身一人
Dialogue: 8,0:21:57.88,0:22:00.47,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,何も覚えてなくて　ずっと一人なんて
Dialogue: 9,0:22:00.47,0:22:02.30,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,想必是很孤独吧
Dialogue: 8,0:22:00.47,0:22:02.30,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,寂しかったよね
Dialogue: 9,0:22:02.30,0:22:03.84,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,想必是很害怕吧
Dialogue: 8,0:22:02.30,0:22:03.84,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,不安だったよね
Dialogue: 9,0:22:04.89,0:22:06.72,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,我很孤独
Dialogue: 8,0:22:04.89,0:22:06.72,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,うん　寂しかったです
Dialogue: 9,0:22:06.72,0:22:11.18,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,所以我遇到你们之后就松了口气  非常高兴
Dialogue: 8,0:22:06.72,0:22:11.18,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,だから　ゆりさんたちと会って　ホッとして　うれしくて
Dialogue: 9,0:22:11.18,0:22:11.94,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,然后…
Dialogue: 8,0:22:11.18,0:22:11.94,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,それで…
Dialogue: 9,0:22:12.27,0:22:15.15,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,那我们今后也一起走吧
Dialogue: 8,0:22:12.27,0:22:15.15,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,じゃあ　これからも一緒にいようよ
Dialogue: 9,0:22:15.15,0:22:17.02,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,请多指教咯  莲华！
Dialogue: 8,0:22:15.15,0:22:17.02,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,よろしくね　れんげちゃん！
Dialogue: 9,0:22:23.57,0:22:24.82,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,百合姐！
Dialogue: 8,0:22:23.57,0:22:24.82,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,ゆりさん！
Dialogue: 9,0:22:24.82,0:22:26.24,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,叫我「百合」就行了
Dialogue: 8,0:22:24.82,0:22:26.24,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,「ゆり」でいいよ
Dialogue: 9,0:22:26.24,0:22:28.33,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,我  我哪能这么没礼貌啊
Dialogue: 8,0:22:26.24,0:22:28.33,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,呼び捨ては無理です
Dialogue: 9,0:22:28.95,0:22:31.45,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,那「小百合」怎么样？
Dialogue: 8,0:22:28.95,0:22:31.45,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,じゃあ　「ゆりちゃん」なんてどうかな？
Dialogue: 9,0:22:31.45,0:22:34.71,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,那么…  小  小…
Dialogue: 8,0:22:31.45,0:22:34.71,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,それなら　ゆ　ゆ…
Dialogue: 9,0:22:34.71,0:22:36.25,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,小百合…
Dialogue: 8,0:22:34.71,0:22:36.25,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,ゆりちゃん…
Dialogue: 9,0:22:39.92,0:22:41.67,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,让我们永远在一起吧
Dialogue: 8,0:22:39.92,0:22:41.67,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,ずっと一緒にいよう
Dialogue: 9,0:22:41.67,0:22:43.09,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,永永远远
Dialogue: 8,0:22:41.67,0:22:43.09,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,ず～っとね
Dialogue: 9,0:22:44.68,0:22:45.59,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,但是…
Dialogue: 8,0:22:44.68,0:22:45.59,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,でも…
Dialogue: 9,0:22:47.14,0:22:49.68,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,我们不能做朋友
Dialogue: 8,0:22:47.14,0:22:49.68,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,お友達にはなれないんだけど
Dialogue: 9,0:22:55.69,0:22:58.73,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,因为要是不在了  会很伤心
Dialogue: 8,0:22:55.69,0:22:58.73,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,いなくなったら　寂しいから
Dialogue: 9,0:23:02.74,0:23:06.91,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,在这一天  曾经孤身一人的我
Dialogue: 8,0:23:02.74,0:23:06.91,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,ひとりぼっちだった私は　この日
Dialogue: 9,0:23:06.91,0:23:10.41,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,遇到了难以忘怀的一生挚友
Dialogue: 8,0:23:06.91,0:23:10.41,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,忘れられない　一生の友達と出会った
Dialogue: 9,0:23:11.33,0:23:12.58,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,小莲！
Dialogue: 8,0:23:11.33,0:23:12.58,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,れんちゃん！
Dialogue: 9,0:23:12.58,0:23:15.50,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,让我们今后不断地来做开心的事吧
Dialogue: 8,0:23:12.58,0:23:15.50,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,これからドンドンドーンって楽しいことをしようね！
Dialogue: 9,0:23:15.50,0:23:16.96,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,好的  小百合
Dialogue: 8,0:23:15.50,0:23:16.96,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,はい　ゆりちゃん
Dialogue: 9,0:23:16.96,0:23:20.42,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,一  一想到必须要做开心的事我就紧张起来了
Dialogue: 8,0:23:16.96,0:23:20.42,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,た　た　楽しいことしなきゃって思うと緊張してきました
Dialogue: 9,0:23:20.42,0:23:22.42,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,这会紧张吗？
Dialogue: 8,0:23:20.42,0:23:22.42,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,そこで緊張しちゃうの？
Dialogue: 9,0:23:22.42,0:23:24.92,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,但是我反而越来越兴奋了
Dialogue: 8,0:23:22.42,0:23:24.92,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,でも　ドンドンドキドキしちゃうね
Dialogue: 9,0:23:24.92,0:23:26.89,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,不如想想能做什么开心的割烹吧
Dialogue: 8,0:23:24.92,0:23:26.89,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,楽しいかっぽうとか考えても
Dialogue: 9,0:23:26.89,0:23:27.76,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,割烹？
Dialogue: 8,0:23:26.89,0:23:27.76,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,割烹!?
Dialogue: 9,0:23:27.76,0:23:29.22,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,我超兴奋的！
Dialogue: 8,0:23:27.76,0:23:29.22,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,ドキドキです！
Dialogue: 9,0:23:31.77,0:23:36.31,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,和小莲在一起  我们今后也一定能不断前进！
Dialogue: 8,0:23:31.77,0:23:36.31,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,れんちゃんと一緒なら　私たちきっとこの先に進めると思う！
Dialogue: 9,0:23:36.44,0:23:40.94,Text - CN - top,All,0,0,0,,{=86}下一集  大家一起做的罐装鲭鱼意大利风番茄火锅
Dialogue: 8,0:23:36.44,0:23:40.94,Text - JP - top,All,0,0,0,,{=204}次回！ みんなと一緒のサバ缶のイタリア風トマト鍋！

